<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu kikwitangwa WALAMUZI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walamuzi Walam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALAMUZI</para>
  <para style="imt">Utambalisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Walamuzi chalonga zimbuli za Waizilaeli aho weze wapate uhumi wa nk'hongo we isi ya Kanaani. Ulwo lwandaga ni lupisi lwa kuuiyauiya kusaguka na kukombolwa. Mazua yamwenga Waizilaeli wakongaga kuvika milungu ya mahili. Niyo Mnungu awegaila want'u we si nt'huhu vileke ziwagele mwa makunt'ho. Aho want'hu wamwiiilaga Mnungu valekaga naho Mnungu awenk'he want'hu wetangwagwa Walamuzi vileke wawalongoze want'hu na kuwakombola kulawa mwa makunt'ho ayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kubula ivi haluse, awandike kitabu iki hamanyike. Wakale wengi wahuwila kugamba kitabu iki chawandikwagwa ni mlotezi Samweli, mna vadahika kunda kindedi kugamba kitabu iki chawandikwagwa umwo Waizilaeli wapataga kale seuta ywaywe kwaviya ilagiswa nk'hanana nyingi kugamba Waizilaeli hawandaga na seuta mwo lupisi ulwo. Uneva Waizilaeli walawaga mwo utumwa uko Misili mwo mwaka 1,400 umwo Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Ino yalagisa zimbuli zimwe kitabu iki yalailaga mwo mwaka uwo (Kaula utambalisi mwe kitabu kikwitangwa Kulawa kwa kwongezela ukombaganyi) nuko kugamba vadahika Walamuzi walailaga mwo mwaka 1,300 Kilisito hanati elekwe mpaka 1,050 Kilisito hanati elekwe umwo Sauli andaga seuta:</para>
  <para style="iot">Ayo yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Kitabu iki chalonga nk'hondo yo uheelo na Wakanaani aho Yoshua eze abanike naho chalonga mbuli yo lupisi Mnungu awenk'haga vilongozi na walamuzi vileke wawalongoze na kuwakombola Waizilaeli milango ya 1-3:6.</para>
  <para style="io">Iviyaiviya kitabu iki chalonga mwe mbuli ya walamuzi we hengi awo Munugu awo Mnungu awegale vileke wawaambize 3:7-16:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Naho kitabu icho chalonga kusaguka kwingi kwa Waizilaeli 17-21.</para>
  <para style="io">Uheelo wakwe chalagisa kugamba Waizilaeli nawakaunga seuta akumwelela Mungu vileke awalongoze kudamanya yakuungwa ha Mnungu kujink'ha kunda na vilongozi wakudamanya yadya wakuyaona kugamba ni kindedi kwa woho wenye.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli watoana na Wakanaani wasigale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Aho Yoshua eze abanike, Waizilaeli wamuuzaga Zumbe Mnungu wakagamba, “Kabila dihi dikuunga dinde dya nk'hongo kwo kutowana na Wakanaani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo awahitula, “Kabila dya Yuda nidyo nedinde dya nk'hongo kutowana nawo kwaviya hiwenk'ha udahi wa kuitaha isi iyo.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda wawagambaga wandugu zawe we dikabila dya Simioni, “Kikwelanyeni mwe isi kink'higwe vileke kikatowane na Wakanaani. Suwe naswe nekindanye na nyuwe kikaitoanile isi mwink'higwe.” Ivo dikabila dya Simioni niyo dyaita nawo.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Ivo want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda wagendaga kutowana na Wakanaani na Wapelezi na kuwahuma, wawakomaga want'hu alufu mlongo uko kwo mzi wa Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Mwo mzi uwo wambwilaga seuta Adoni Bezeki niyo watoana naye na kuwatowa Wakanaani na Wapelezi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Mna Adoni Bezeki anyilikaga niyo woho wamgulusaga na kumgwiila, no kumkant'ha madole makulu yakwe mwe mikono na mwe viga.<verse eid="JDG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adoni Bezeki niyo agamba, “Maseuta milongo mfungate nawakant'haga madole makulu ya mwe mikono na mwe viga walogotaga masavu ya nk'hande yadondomoke hasi ye meza yangu. Haluse Mnungu kaniliha enga ivo nitendile.” Wamwigalaga Yelusalemu niyo abanikila uko.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda wautowaga mzi wa Yelusalemu na kuutaha. Wawakomaga want'hu wa mzi uwo kwa mabamba na kuutimp'ha moto.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Akajika want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda waseelaga wakatowane na Wakaanani wandaga wakekala mwe isi ye vigulu, isi ya Negebu na mawandamo ya usweelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Wawabasaga want'hu wa Wakaanani wekalaga Hebuloni uwo mzi wa Aba niyo waitowa mizi ya Sheshai na Ahimani na Talimai. <verse eid="JDG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Weze walawe uko want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda wagendaga kuutowa mzi wa Debili, uwo wetangwagwa Kiliasi Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Kalebu niyo agamba, “Mnt'hu yeyose akuunga awatowe na kuutaha mzi wa Kiliati Sefeli nenimloze mwanangu Akisa.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Ivo Osinieli mwana Kenazi mvunawe dya Kalebu autahaga umzi, Kalebu niyo amloza mwanawe Akisa kwa Osinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa eze abule kwa Osinieli amgambaga, “Lombeza nk'honde kwa tate.” Akisa andaga mwe mp'hunda eze aseele mwe mp'hunda ise niyo amuuza, “Waungai?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Niyo amhitula, “Naunga vizuto va mazi enga ivo unink'hile isi ya Negebu.” Ivo Kalebu niyo amwink'ha isi ye vizuto va kukenya na mwondwaisi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Awo wana Mkeni uyo mkwewe dya Musa, wakwelaga kulawa kwo mzi we mitende, uwo ukwitangwa Yeliko, wakekale hamwenga na want'hu wa kwe dijangwa dya Yuda uko Negebu hagihi na Alaba. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Ivo want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda waitaga na wandugu zawe Wasimioni niyo wawatoa Wakanaani wekalaga Sefasi niyo waubananga pele mzi uwo. Zina dya mzi uwo wetangwagwa Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Ivo Want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda waitahaga mizi ya Gaza ne zikaya zakwe na Ashikeloni ne zikaya zakwe na Ekiloni ne zikaya zakwe.<verse eid="JDG 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Zumbe Mnungu andaga hamwenga na want'hu we dikabila dya Yuda. Waitahaga isi ye vigulu mna hawadaile kuwahuma wakaya we isi iyo kwaviya wandaga na magali ya kilama. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Kalebu enk'wagwa mzi wa Hebuloni enga ivo Musa alongaga, Kalebu niyo azigulusa zink'holo izo zint'hatu za Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Mna want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini hawawaguluse Wayebusi awo wandaga wakekala mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Nivo vikuleka Wayebusi wekala hamwenga na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu mpaka ivi haluse.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ya Efulaimu na Manase waihuma Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Yosefu wautoaga mzi wa Beseli, Zumbe Mnungu awambizaga. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Wawatumaga wakaupelembe mzi wa Beseli. Aho nk'hongo mzi uwo wetangwagwa Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Wapelembi awo wamuonaga mnt'hu yumwenga akalawa mwo mzi, niyo wamgamba, “Kilagise ivo nekingile mwo mzi naswe hekikukome.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Ivo niyo wengila mwo mzi, nawo niyo wakoma kila kint'hu kwa sime. Mna wamlekaga yudya mnt'hu akanda mgima ne mp'huga yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Mnt'hu uyo aitaga mwe isi ya Wahiti niyo azenga mzi wakwe niyo awitanga Luzu. Nidyo dizina dyakwe hata ivi dielo.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu heweguluswe ni Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Mna want'hu we dikabila dya Manase hawawaguluse want'hu wekalaga Besi Sheani hegu want'hu wekalaga Taanaki hegu want'hu wekalaga Doli hegu want'hu wekalaga Ibeleamu hegu want'hu wekalga Megido ne zikaya zakwe zi mgihi. Wakanaani walemelaga kufosa mwe isi idya. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Waizilaeli weze wapate ludole wawatigizaga Wakanaani mwe zindima zawe mna hawawaguluse wafose mwe isi. <verse eid="JDG 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Ifulaimu hawawaguluse Wakanaani wakwikala Gezeli mna Wakanaani wagendeelaga kwikala ukwo hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="JDG 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Zabuloni hawawaguluse Wakanaani wakwikala kwo mzi wa Kitiloni hegu wakwikala kwo mzi wa Nahalali, wagendeelaga kwikala hamwenga nawo wakawatigiza kudamanya ndima. <verse eid="JDG 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Hata want'hu wa Asheli hawawaguluse wadya wakwikala Ako na Sidoni na Alabu na Akizibu na Heliba na Afeka na Lehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Ivo want'hu we dikabila dya Asheli niyo wekala hamwenga na Wakanaani wakaya we isi iyo kwaviya hawawagulusaga. <verse eid="JDG 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Nafutali hawawaguluse wadya wakwikala mwo mizi ya Beti Shemeshi hegu wadya wakwikala Beti Anasi. Mna want'hu wa Nafutali wekalaga na Wakanaani na kuwatigiza kuwadamanyila ndima. <verse eid="JDG 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Waamoli wawagulusaga want'hu we dikabila dya Dani kwe isi ye vigulu. Hawaungile weze wekale mwe isi ya nt'hindiga. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Waamoli wagendeelaga kwikala mwe mizi iyo yandaga mwo mnima wa Helesi na Aiyaloni na Shaalibimu. Mna want'hu we dikabila dya Manase na Efulaimu wawekailaga Waamoli na kuwatigiza wawadamanyile ndima. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mhaka wa Waamoli wandaga mkoma mahanya ye Sela kombokelamneka wa Akalibimu na kugendeela.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe uko Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe akwelaga kulawa Giligali mpaka Bokimu niyo awagamba Waizilaeli kugamba, “Zumbe kagamba, hiwalavani mwe isi ya Misili na kuwegala mwe isi iyo nakelisile kwa wakale wenyu, hagamba, ‘Heniuse Indagano yangu niikile na nyuwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Nanywe hamkuungwa kuika Ndagano na want'hu we isi ino, mna banangeni hant'hu hawe ha kulavila nt'hambiko.’ Mna nyuwe hamnitegeleze. Nii mkatenda ivi? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Haluse nawagambani kugamba, heniwaguluse kwenyu, mna nawande enga miwa kwenyu naho milungu yawe neinde lwinika kwenyu kwa kuivika.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe eze awagambile want'hu wose wa Izilaeli ulosi uno, watulaga ndilo. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Wahetangaga hant'hu aho Bokimu, nuko kugamba hant'hu ha ndilo. Niyo wamlavila Zumbe Mnungu malavo.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Aho Yoshua eze awalage Waizilaeli, kila yumwenga aitaga hant'hu hakwe aho apangilwe vileke ahaguhe hande hakwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Waizilaeli wamdamanyiliga Zumbe mazuwa yose mwo ugima wa Yoshua, na mazuwa yose yo ugima wa wadala awo wandaga aaho Yoshua eze abanike awo waonaga zindima zose izo Zumbe awadamanyilaga Waizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshua mwana Nuni naho mndima ywa Zumbe Mnungu, abanikaga akanda na miyaka gana dimwenga na mlongo. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Wammoselaga msanga mwa hant'hu apangilwe inde yakwe uko Timanati Helesi, mwe isi ye milima ya Efulaimu mkoma mahanya yo mnima Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Mna cheleko chakwe chose chakehanganyaga, na kutimila cheleko kituhu icho hachammanyaga Zumbe Mnungu hegu ivo awatendele want'hu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli waleka kumvika Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Ivo, Waizilaeli wadamanya wavu ha Zumbe Mnungu na kuivika milungu ikwitangwa Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Nawamleka Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywa wakale wawe, uyo awalavaga mwe isi ya Misili, na kuivika milungu mituhu ya want'hu wawazunguluke. Waifunamilaga milungu iyo na kumtenda Zumbe Mnungu aihiwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Wamleka Zumbe Mnungu, na kuwadamanyila Mabaali na Mashataloti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu awaihiaga Waizilaeli vitendese, naye niyo awaleka wahoki wawahoke ugoli wawe, na kuwatenda wahumwe ni wank'hondo wawe naho Waizilaeli hawadahaga kukimaala ha wank'hondo wawe. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Aho wagendaga kutoana, udahi wa Zumbe hawandaga hamwenga nawo, enga ivo Zumbe agambaga naatende. Wandaga mwe makunt'ho makulu. <verse eid="JDG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Niho Zumbe Mnungu awenk'hile walamuzi wa kuwalava mwo udahi wa want'hu wawahokile ugoli wawe. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Hata ivo Waizilaeli hawawategeleze, kwaviya wakehabwasaga kwa kutimila milungu mituhu na kuifunamila wakaivika. Wasunguzaga kuileka sila ya wakale wawe. Sila ya kutimila sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Kila aho Zumbe Mnungu akawenk'ha walamuzi, yehe mwenye andaga hamwenga na mlamuzi uyo, awayokolaga kulawa mwa wank'hondo wawe mwo lupisi lwose lwo wikazi wo mlamuzi uyo. Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu awaonelaga mbazi umwo awevaga wakasulumila kulawa kwa awo wandaga wakawasulumiza. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Mna aho mlamuzi eze abanike woho wauwiyaga udamanyi wawe wa kale, na wavu wiihile kujink'ha watati zawe. Waitimilaga milungu mituhu, wakaidamanyila ndima na kuivika, naho hawalekaga udamanyi na wiihi wawe. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu anda na maya mwa Izilaeli, akagamba, “Kwaviya want'hu awa wabananga lndagano niidamanye na wakale wawe, na kulemela kutimila yadya nilongile, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />heniziguluse naho isi izo Yoshua azisigaze umwo abanikaga. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Nenizitende si izo ziwageze Waizilaeli nikaule kugamba nawauwiye sila yangu enga watati zawe hegu bule.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu awalekaga want'hu wa si izo wasigale, naho hasunguzaga kuwagulusa aho Yoshua eze abanike.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Want'hu wasigale mwe isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Zumbe Mnungu awalekaga want'hu wa si izi, vileke wawageze Waizilaeli awo wandaga hawanati watowane nk'hondo mwe isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Atendaga ivo vileke awenk'he ' want'hu we vyeleko ivo umanyi wa kutoana nk'hondo, kwaviya wandaga hawanati waone nk'hondo. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Awo wasigale mwe isi wandaga ni Wafilisiti, na Wakanaani wose na Wasidoni na Waivi wekalaga mwo milima ya Lebanoni kulawa mwo mnima Baali Helimoni mpaka mwa magundi ya Hamati. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Wasigazwagwa vileke wawageze Waizilaeli, akaule uneva nawazumile zisigilizi zakwe awasigiilaga wakale wawe kwa kombokela Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Ivo, Waizilaeli nawekala hamwenga na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelezi na Waivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Niyo walombelana na want'hu awo na kuivika milungu yawe.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Waizilaeli nawadamanya wiihi ha Zumbe Mnungu, niyo wamjala Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywawe, niyo wavika Mabaali na Mashela. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Maya ya Mnungu yemukwagwa kwaajili ya Waizilaeli niyo amtenda seuta Kushani Lishataimu ywa Mesopotamia awahume Waizilaeli. Wamdamanyilaga kwa miaka mnane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Mna weze wamwiile Zumbe, yehe awenk'haga mkombozi, Osinieli mwana Kenazi, mvunawe dya Kalebu uyo awakombolaga. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Ivo, Muye ywa Mnungu amwiziilaga Otinieli niyo anda kilongozi ywa Izilaeli. Otinieli niyo aita kwe nk'hondo Zumbe Mnungu naye niyo amwiika Kushi Lishataimu seuta ywa Mesopotamia mwo udahi wa Otinieli. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ivo isi yandaga na utondowazi kwa lupisi lwa miaka milongo mine. Otinieli mwana Kenazi niyo abanika.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi anda mlamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Waizilaeli watendaga wiihi ha Zumbe Mnungu. Zumbe Mnungu niyo amwink'ha udahi seuta Eguloni ywa Moabu awahume Waizilaeli, kwaviya nawamtendela Zumbe Mnungu uwihi. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Seuta Eguloni awaduganyaga Waamoni na Waamaleki niyo agenda kutowana na Waizilaeli, wawahumaga Waizilaeli na kuutaha mzi we Mitende uwo ukwitangwa Yeliko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Waizilaeli niyo wamdamanyila seuta ywa Moabu kwa lupisi lwa miaka mlongo na mnane. <verse eid="JDG 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Mna Waizilaeli wamwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu naho. Zumbe naye niyo awenk'ha mnt'hu ywa kuwakombola, uyo Ehudi mwana Gela, mta moso, we dikabila dya Benjamini. Waizilaeli wamtumaga egale mageleko yawe kwa Eguloni seuta ywa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi niyo asana sime, yandaga na utali wa sentimita milongo mishano. Niyo akekaka kulume kundani kwe suke yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Niyo amwigaila mageleko Eguloni seuta ywa Moabu. Eguloni andaga zint'hu nene. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi eze ajike kulava mageleko ayo, awagambaga wadya want'hu wenulaga mageleko ayo wakeitile. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Mna yehe eze abule kwa mahili ya maiwe yasongolwe hagihi na Giligali, amwuuiyaga Eguloni na kumgamba, “Nna ulosi wa kinyele kwako weye seuta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Seuta niyo awagamba wandima wakwe “Hake kisogeleni.” Wandima wakwe niyo wafosa kuse.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ivo Ehudi niyo amsogeela hagihi na hadya ekale mwe chumba chakwe kihoile he balaza, “Nna ulosi wako kulawa kwa Mnungu.” Seuta niyo enuka mwe difumbi dyakwe na kukimala. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi niyo asomola sime yakwe no mkono wa kumoso kulawa kulume kwakwe, na kumjunga Egiloni mwe zinda zakwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Isime yose hamwenga no mhini wakwe vadidimilaga mndani mwe zinda. Mavuta yajabalazaga idya isime, Ehudi hailavaga isime idya mwe zinda za seuta Eguloni. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Eze ajike Ehudi afosaga kuse na kuvugala zinyivi ze chumba icho. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi eze ahalawe, wandima wa seuta niyo wauya. Weze wakaule zinyivi zose zandaga zivugalwa, nawafanyanya kugamba andaga kazunguluka mndani mwe nyumba. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Wagojela niyo wahwa mna hawakomolaga zinyivi ze chumba, waguhaga nk'homoelo niyo wakomola. Weze wakomole wamuonaga seuta ywawe kagwa hasi naho kabanika.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Umwo wandaga wakagoja, Ehudi anyilikaga kombokela mwa mahili ya maiwe, na kuita Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Eze abule uko mwe isi ye vigulu va Efulaimu atoaga gunda, Waizilaeli nawo waseelaga hamwenga nae kulawa kwe vigulu, yehe niyo awalongoela, <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />akawagamba, “Nitimileni, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kawenk'hani uhumi mwa wak'hondo wenyu Wamoabu.” Ivo wamtimilaga Ehudi na kuihataha midando yo mto Yolodani, hamlekele mnt'hu yeyose adendeluke. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Zuwa idyo wawakomaga Wamoabu milongo alufu, want'hu wose wandaga na ludole na wata udahi wa nk'hondo, hakwandaga na mnt'hu hata yumwenga ahonaga. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Zuwa idyo Waizilaeli wawahumaga Wamoabu. Isi niyo yanda na utondowazi kwa miaka milongo mnane.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgali,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Ehudi eze ahalawe, ezaga Shamgali mwana Anati. Shamgali awakomaga Wafilisiti Magana mtandatu kwa ngoda ya kudimila. Yehe naye awakombolaga Waizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Umwo Ehudi eze abanike, Waizilaeli wadamanyaga uwihi ha Zumbe. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo awaika mwo udahi wa Yabini, seuta ywa Kanaani, uyo ekalaga uko Hazoli. Mkulu ywe difyo dya watowani wakwe etangwagwa Sisela mkaya ywa Halosheti Hagoimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Seuta Yabini andaga na magali ya kuvutigwa ni Falasi yakubula magana kenda ya kilama. Awatendelaga Waizilaeli ukwank'hwalu kwa miaka milongo miidi, nawo niyo wamwiila Zumbe Mnungu awaambize.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Mwo lupisi ulwo, kwandaga na mlotezi ywe kivele etangwagwa Debola, mkaza Lapidoti, andaga mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli mwo lupisi ulo. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debola andaga akadamanyila ndima hasi yo mtende wandaga mwo mzi wa Lama na mzi wa Beteli mwe isi ye vigulu ya Efulaimu. Want'hu wa Izilaeli wamwiizilaga vileke awalamule masa yawe. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Zuwa dimwenga amwitangaga Balaki mwana ywa Abinoamu ywa Kadeshi mwe isi ya Nafutali, eze eze amgambaga, “Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, kagamba, ‘Kaduganye want'hu alufu mlongo kulawa mwa makabila ya Nafutali na Zebuloni. Uwalongoze kuita kwo mnima wa Tabali. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Miye nenimtende Sisela, mkulu ywa Watoani wa Yabini akanda na magali yakwe ya nk'hondo, atowane na nyuwe kwo mto Kishoni. Miye nohwink'he uhumi mwakwe.’”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balaki niyo amgamba Debola, “Uneva nekiitanye, neniite, mna uneva hekiitanye na weye miye heniite.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola niyo amhitula, “Ni vedi, neniite hamwenga na weye, mna houpate nt'hunyo yeyose yo uhumi wa nk'hondo, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kamwink'ha ludole uyo mvele amhume Sisela.” Ivo Debola niyo atimilana na Balaki wakaita Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Balaki niyo ayetanga makabila ya Nafutali na Zabuloni uko Kadeshi, want'hu alufu mlongo wakwelaga wakamtimila. Debola nae aitaga hamwenga nae.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Mwo lupisi ulo, Hebeli uyo wo lukolo lwa Wakeni andaga kakepagula na Wakeni weyawe awo welekwa wa Hobabu, mnamuwe dya Musa, akimaga hema dyakwe hagihi no mti ukwitangwa Mwaloni wa Zaananimu uwo wandaga hagihi na Kadeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Sisela eze eve kugamba Balaki mwana ywa Abinoamu kaita kwo mnima Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisela aduganyaga magali yakwe milongo kenda ya kilama na akanda hamwenga na wagosi wose, ahalawaga Halosheti Hagoimu kuita kwo mto Kishoni.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debola niyo amgamba Balaki, “Ita! Dielo nidyo dizuwa Zumbe Mnungu akwink'hile udahi wa kumhuma Sisela. Zumbe Mnungu akulongoela.” Ivo Balaki niyo aseela kulawa kwo mnima Taboli na kuwalongoza want'hu wakwe alufu mlongo. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Umwo Balaki na watowanoi wakwe weze wamtowe Sisela Zumbe niyo awazaganya Sisela na watoani wakwe wose na magali yakwe ya nk'hondo wasekumanya mitoanile. Sisela aseelaga mwe digali dyakwe, niyo anyilika. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Balaki niyo awatimila watoani awo na magali mpaka Halosheti Hagoimu na kuwakoma watoani wose wa Sisela kwa sime, hakusigale hata yumwenga.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Mna Sisela niyo aguluka mpaka kwe dihema dya Yaeli, mkaza Hebelu lukolo lwa Wakeni. Adamanyaga ivo kwaviya nokunda na Ndagano ya utondowazi mwa seuta Yabini ywa Hezoli ne mp'huga ya Hebeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli niyo amgamba Sisela, “Zumbe ywangu, so kwangu, naho usekogoha.” Sisela engilaga mwe dihema dyakwe niyo amgubika ne suke izamile. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisela amgambaga Yaeli, “Nakulombeza unink'he mazi ninywe, kwaviya nna nk'hilu.” Agubulaga kabete kandaga na mele niyo amwink'ha niyo anywa, niyo amgubika naho. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisela niyo amgamba, “Kimala ho lwivi lwe dihema. Mnt'hu yeyose aneza kukuuza kugamba, hana mnt'hu yeyose aha, umgambe hahali.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Mna Sisela kwaviya asokelesaga agonesaga. Yaeli mkaza Hebeli aguhaga kigingi na nk'humbo mwo mkono wakwe na kumbasa mp'halahole niyo akigomandila mwe kihanga chakwe niyo chalawanya mpaka mwe sanga. Ivo Siseli niyo abanika. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Umwo Balaki andaga akamtimila Sisela, Yaeli afosaga kuse akamsingile niyo amgamba, “Soo kwangu nohulagise mnt'hu ukumzungula.” Balaki niyo engila mwe dihema dya Yaeli na kumbwiila Siseli hasi, kabanika naho kigingi che dihema kigomandilwa mwe kihanga chakwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Ivo, zuwa idyo Zumbe Mnungu awenk'haga Waizilaeli uhumi mwa seuta Yabini ywa Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Waizilaeli niyo wagendeela kumkulumbuza Yabini, seuta ywa Kanaani, mpaka aho wakumkomaga pele.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Ukemi wa Debola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Zuwa idyo, Debola na Balaki mwana Abinoamu wakemaga wila uno:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Vilongozi wakelaviliza kwikaila Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Want'hu nawo wakelavaga kwa kuunga wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Tegelezeni nyuwe maseuta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Naho nyuwe wakulu tegelezeseni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Miye nenimkemele Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Nenikeme nt'hogola kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu wize ulawe uko Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">na kuseela mwo mnima Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">isi neizingiza, ulanga nouseleza mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Heiye mavunde niyo yaseleza fula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Milima neizingiza hako Zumbe Mnungu, heiye, mnima Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">hako Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mwa mazuwa ya Shamgali, mwana Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mwo lupisi lwa Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">ludongo lwa want'hu nolunda halukomboka mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">watafi wombokaga kifiso mnk'handa.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Wikazi we zikaya wahelezaga mwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">wahelezaga mpaka eze alaile Dobola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">eze alaile mami yawe dya Waizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Weze waakesaguile milungu mihya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">niyo kwanda nk'hondo mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Mna hakwandile na mta mjungo hegu nk'hindilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">mwa want'hu alufu milongo mine mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Nawatunya wakulu wawatowani wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">na want'hu wakelavile kwa kuunga wenye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mtogoleni Zumbe!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Bwelekezeni nyuwe mkugendeza zimp'hunda zing'aile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">Bwelekezeni nyuwe mkwikaila vilago vikuikwa mnanaga mwe mp'hunda va yombe kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">na nyuwe mkugenda mwe sila.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Tegelezeni izwi hamwenga na kwanga kwa wakulasa na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">kwanga kwa wakuteka mazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">kwabwelekeza uhumi wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">uhumi wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Want'hu wa Zumbe waseela kulawa kwe zink'hili zawe<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Inuka, inuka, Debola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Inuka! inuka ukeme wila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Inuka, Balaki mwana Abinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">uwaguhe watahigwa wako.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Watoani wasigale nawaseela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">want'hu wa Zumbe Mnungu wagenda kumtoanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">mwa want'hu wana ludole.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Kulawa Efulaimu waseelaga awo wandaga wakekala kwa Waamaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Benjamini andaga hamwenga na want'hu wakutimilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">watowani wakulu waseelaga kulawa Makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">wakulu waseelaga kulawa Zebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Wakulu wa Isakali wandaga hamwenga na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">want'hu wa Isakali wahuwilwa kwa Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wamtimilaga mpaka kwe dikolongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Mna mwe mp'huga ya Lubeni wakepangaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">waswesaga ulamuzi.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Nii mwekala kunyuma ne zingoto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">mkategeleza miluzi yo mdimi akwitanga mifugwa yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Heiye, dikabila dya Lubeni dikepanganiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">hawadahaga kufanyanya mbuli zikwiza.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Dikabila dya Gileadi dyasigalaga nt'hendelo ya kaidi ya Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Kabila dya Dani nii nomsigala mwe melikebu mazuwa mengi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Kabila dya Asheli nedisigala mnk'handa ye bahali hant'hu meli zikukimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">no kwikala mwe mp'wani yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Mna want'hu wa Zebuloni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">wakelavaga ugima wawe hata uneva nawaugwa wabanike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Nivo watendaga want'hu wa Nafutali uko kwa magundi ye nk'hondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Kudya Taanaki mnk'handa ye zinc'hoko za mazi za Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">maseuta wezaga, niyo watowa nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">maseuta wa Kanaani watowaga nk'hondo uko Taanaki hagihi ne zinc'hoko za mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">mna hawaguhile masawa hegu vitahigwa.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Uko kwe mbingu nt'hondo nezinda mwe nk'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">Nt'hondo mwe zinyendo zawe, zatowanaga na Sisela.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Malao yo mto Kishoni yawakubilaga hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">udya mto wa kale, mto wa Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Neniite, nenigendeele kulongole kwa udahi.<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Niyo ngaga ze zifalasi zalavaga sindo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">aho weze wazitende zifalasi ziguluke kwa kukwatula hasi,<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe niyo agamba, “Uligiteni mzi wa Melosi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">“Waligiteni want'hu wakwikala umwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kwaviya hawezile kuwambiza want'hu wa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kutowana na wank'hondo wata ludole.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yaeli avikilwe kujink'ha wavele wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">mkaza Hebeli uyo ywo lukolo lwa Wakeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Naavikilwe kujink'ha wavele wose wakwikala mwe mahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisela amlombezaga mazi, yehe niyo amwink'ha mele mwe kihungu cha kiseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">na kumletela siagi mwe kihungu cha nt'hogola.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kwa mkono umwenga atoza kigingi che dihema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">na mkono wakwe wa kulume atozaga nk'humbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">iyo agomandilaga ikigindi mwo mtwi wa Sisela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">amponk'holaga mtwi wakwe.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela afunamaga mwe viga vakwe niyo agwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">na kugona mwe viga vakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Agwaga hasi, kabanika!<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Nine dya Sisela asungiilaga kuse mwe dilanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">eze asungile ailaga akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Nii gali dyakwe dikuvutwa ni falasi hadisunguze kwiza?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Nii zifalasi zakwe hazisunguze kuuya?”<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Wavele wata mizungu wamhitulaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">ikindedi akesangalazaga zuwa kwa zuwa.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />“Wazungula vint'hu va kuvitaha na kupangilana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mvele yumwenga hegu waidi kila mtowani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mavalo ya langi zihengi kwa ajili ya Sisela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mavalo yahambigwe kwaajili ye singo yangu.”<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Zumbe Mnungu uwabanange wank'hondo wako wose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Mna wambwiyazo wan'gale enga zuwa dikutont'homoka! Mwo lupisi dikutont'homoka kwa kung'ala</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 5:31">Isi yose niyo yanda na utondowazi kwa miaka milongo mine.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Wamidiani wawekaila Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Waizilaeli watendaga uihi ha Zumbe, niyo Zumbe awaleka wekailwe ni Wamidiani kwa lupisi lwa miyaka mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Wamidiani wawasulumizaga vitendese Waizilaeli, ivo Waizilaeli wawanyilikaga na kukefisa kwa mabome na mp'hanga uko kwo mnima. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Kila aho Waizilaeli wahandaga mbeyu zawe uko kwo mgunda, Wamidiani na Wamaleki na want'hu watuhu wa uko ulailo wa zuwa wezaga kuwatowa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />si izo neziika nk'hambi mwe isi, na kubananga ulozo wose mwe isi mpaka mhaka na Gaza, Waizilaeli hawasilwagwa chochose, ngoto hegu ng'ombe hegu mp'hunda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Wezaga wengi enga sige wakanda na mahema na mifugwa yawe, woho ne ngamia zawe zandaga wengi hewekuwazika ivo waibananga isi ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Wamidiani wawatendaga Waizilaeli kunda wakiwa. Waizilaeli wamwiilaga Zumbe.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Waizilaeli weze wamwiile Zumbe Mnungu awausile makunt'ho ayo wayapataga kwa Wamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Zumbe Mnungu awenk'haga mlotezi. Mlotezi uyo niyo awagamba, Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli agambaga, “Nawalavagani mwe isi ya Misili uko mwandaga watumwa. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Naho nawakombolagani mwo udahi wa Wamisili na kulawa mwa want'hu watowanaga na nyuwe mwe isi ino. Nawagulusaga umwo mwandile mkeza niyo nawenk'hani isi yawe. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Nawagambilagani kugamba ni miye Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu, naho msekuivika milungu ya Waamoli awo mkwikala mwe isi yawe. Mna hamwanitegelezaga.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe niyo aita na kwikala hasi yo mti wa mwaloni wa Yoashi ywo lukolo lwa Waabiezeli uko Ofula. Gidioni mwana ywa Yoashi andaga akaheta ngano, kundani hant'hu ha kukamila zabibu vileke Wamidiani wasekumuona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe Mnungu amlailaga akamgamba, “Zumbe Mnungu ehamwenga na weye mtoani hekogoha.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidioni niyo amgamba, “Mkulu, uneva Zumbe Mnungu ehamwenga na suwe, nii mbuli izi zose zilaila kwetu? Wikuhi udamanyi wa kweheela uwo chagambilwagwa na wakale wetu wakagamba, hiyo Zumbe akigalavga kulawa Misili. Mna Zumbe kakileka naho kukitenda kikailwe ni Wamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu amhitukilaga na kumgamba, “Ita kwa udahi uwo unanao, ukaikombole Izilaeli kulawa mwa Wamidiani. Ni miye mwenye hukutuma.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidioni niyo amhitula, “Mna Zumbe, nenidahe vivihi kuikombola Izilaeli? lukolo lwangu nulo lusokelese mwe dikabila dya Manase, miye mwenye name ni mdodo mwe kaya yetu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Nohwink'he udahi, naho weye nouwatowe Wamidiani enga kugamba wakoma mnt'hu yumwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidioni niyo amgamba, “Uneva kunizumila, unink'he kilagiso kugamba ni weye kindedi ulongile na miye. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Nakulombeza usekuhalawa aha mpaka aho neniuye na kukwigaila malavo yangu na kuika hameso hako.” Naye amhitulaga, “Nehugoje aha mpaka aho nouwiye.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidioni engilaga kwe nyumba niyo ambika nyama ya mbuzi na mikate na makopo mlongo ya unga heigeligwe ugwadu. Aigelaga idya inyama mwe nt'hangulu, niyo agela msuzi mwe nyungu na kumwigaila hasi yo mti wa mwaloni na kumwink'ha. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Mtumigwa ywa Mnungu amgambaga, “Guha inyama ne mikate iyo uwiike mnanga mwo luwe ulu. Akajika gela msuzi mnanga mwe nyama ne mikate.” Naye niyo adamanya ivo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe alolotezaga ne ngoda niyo akwafa inyama ne mikate. Aaho moto walawaga mwo luwe niyo wayoka pele idya inyama ne mikate. Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe niyo aga.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gidioni eze amanye kugamba yudya andaga mtumigwa ywa Zumbe Mnungu, ogohaga niyo agamba, “Ha! Zumbe, hangi miye mwenye, kwaviya himuona mtumigwa ywako na meso yangu!”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Utondowazi unde na weye! Usekogoha naho houbanike.”<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidioni amzengelaga Zumbe Mnungu hant'hu ha kulavila malavo uko na kuhetanga, “Zumbe Mnungu ni utondowazi” Hant'hu ha kulavila malavo. Hant'hu aho hakei uuko uko Ofula ya Wabiezeli mpaka dielo.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Kilo icho Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga Gidioni, “Guha njeku imwenga kwa iso, njeku idya ya kaidi ya lika dya miyaka mfungate. Mola hant'hu ha iso hant'hu ha nt'hambiko kwa Baali, bananga dihili dya Ashela dihank'handa hakwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Ukamzengele Zumbe Mnungu ywako kilingo cho kutambikila enga ivo vikuungwa aha he digundi idi, niyo wanilavila malavo ya kokwa pele ye njeku idya ya kaidi kwa nk'huni ze dihili diya dya Ashela wadimoile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Ivo, Gidioni aguhaga wandima wakwe mlongo, adamanyaga enga ivo alagizwagwa ni Zumbe Mnungu. Mna kwaviya awogohoga wanduguze na want'hu wa komzi, hadahile kuyadamanya ayo nomsi, ivo ayadamanyaga nekilo.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Kilokilo wakaya wo mzi weze wenuke waonaga kilingo cha nt'hambiko ya Baali no mkola wa Ashela wandile hadya umoligwa. Idya njeku yandaga yokigwa mnanga mwe kilingo cho kutambikila kizengigwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Wakeuzaga, “Niani adamanye mbuli ino?” Weze wadamanye upelembi, wabunk'hulaga kugamba ni Gidioni mwana Yoashi niye adamanye aya. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Wakaya wo mzi niyo wamwizila Yoashi, wakamgamba, “Mlave mwanao kimkome, kwaviya kamola kilingo cho kutambikila cha Baali na kudibozola dihili dya Ashela idyo dyandaga hagihi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Ivo Yoashi niyo awagamba wose wamwiziilaga, “Nyuwe mwamgombela Baali? Mwageza kumyokola? Yeyose akuunga amgombele naakomigwe kukei kutandazuka. Uneva Baali ni Mnungu kindedi naakegombele mwenye umwo mnt'hu akamola kilingo chakwe cha kutambikila.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Zuwa idyo wamwitangaga Gidioni “Yelu Baali”, Nukokugamba “Mneke Baali akegombele mwenye”, kwaviya Gidioni amolaga kilingo chakwe cha kutambikila.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Niyo Wamidiani na Waamaleki na makabila yose yakwikala ulailo wa zuwa wadendeluka mto Yolodani na kuika nk'hambi zawe mwe dikolongo dya Yezeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Niyo Muye ywa Mnungu amlongoza Gidioni. Gidioni niyo atoa digunda akawetanga Wabiezeli wamtimile. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Atumaga wegala ulosi mwe isi yose ya Manase weze wamtimile niyo atuma wegala ulosi watuhu wawetange want'hu wa makabila ya Asheli na Zabuloni na Nafutali. Woho nawo wakwelaga wakamtimila.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidioni amgambaga Mnungu, “Uneva noikombole Izilaeli kwa udahi nounink'he enga ivo ugambile, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />Kaula naika nk'hingo ya ngoto ho lwazo lwo kuhetela. Uneva nokunde na mnyuzu uuwo du, mna kiwasa kindanda kinyala niho nenimanye kugamba nouiyokole Izilaeli kwa udahi nounink'he enga ivo ulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Niyo vanda ivo, kwaviya eze enuke, aukamulaga mnyuzu wandaga mnanga mwe kink'ho idya iyo kumemeza lwiga. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidioni niyo agamba, “Mnungu, nakulombeza usekuniihia. Nilekele nilombeze uulu du. Nalombeza nilekele gezo dimwenga du. Mwo lupisi ulu niitende ink'hingo inde inyala mna sanga inde na mnyuzu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Mnungu niyo adamanya ivo kilo icho, kwaviya mnanga mwe nk'hingo mwandaga kunyala mna hasi mwe sanga handaga na mnyuzu.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni awahuma Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Yelubaeli uyo akwitangwa Gidioni na want'hu wakwe wose andaga hamwenga nawo, wenukaga mtondotondo na kukima nk'hambi hagihi ne nc'hoko ya Halodi. Nk'hambi ya Wamidiani nayo neinda mkoma mahanya ye dikolongo hagihi no mnima Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga Gidioni, “Want'hu awo unanao wengi vitendese kwangu miye kuwataha Wamidiani. Vileke Waizilaeli wase kukeduvya kugamba wanda wahumi kwa udahi wawe wenye haheina wambizi wangu. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Uwagambe want'hu kugamba, ‘Yeyose akogoha hegu kuzingiza auye kaya.’” Ivo Gidioni awagezaga want'hu. Want'hu alufu milongo miidi na waidi wauyaga kaya, na want'hu alufu mlongo wasigalaga.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga Gidioni, “Want'hu wakei wengi. Haluse wegale ukwo kwa mazi, miye name neniwageze uko. Uneva nnakugamba, ‘Mnt'hu uyo mwiitanye, uyo nomwiitanye, naho mnt'hu yeyose nohugambe msekuitanya uyo ho mwiitanye.’” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Ivo, Gidioni awegalaga want'hu uko kwa mazi Zumbe niyo amgamba, “Want'hu nawalambite amazi enga kuli nouwapagule na wadya wanywele kwa kufunama na kunywa mazi ne mikono.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Uwazilo wa wadya wanywele mazi wakateka ne mikono yawe wandaga magana matatu. Mna watuhu wose wasigale wafunamaga wakanywa mazi enga kuli. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Gidioni, “Nohuyokole na kukwink'ha uhumi kwa Wamidiani ukanda nao awo want'hu milongo mitatu wanywele mazi kwa kulambita enga kuli. Uwagambe watuhu wose wauye kwe zikaya zawe.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Ivo Gidioni aguhaga nk'hande za wadya wakuuya kaya na magunda yawe na kuwalaga na kuuya kwe zikaya zawe. Yehe niyo asigala na want'hu magana matatu. ne nk'hambi ya Wamidiani neinda mondwaisi yawe kwe dikolongo.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Kilo icho, Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga Gidioni, “Inuka ukawakump'hukile mwe nk'hambi yawe, kwaviya hikwink'ha udahi wa kuwahuma. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Mna uneva wogoha, ita na mndima ywako Pula. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Uko nowive icho wakulonga, weye nawe noupate ludole lwa kugenda kuwatowa.” Ivo Gidioni aitaga na mndima ywakwe Pula mpaka kwe nk'hambi ya Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Wamidiani na Waamaleki na want'hu wa ulailo wa zuwa wagonile mwe dikolongo. Wandaga wengi enga sige, wingi we zingamia zawe enga msanga wa mnk'handa ye bahali.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidioni eze abule, amwivaga mnt'hu yumwenga akamsimuila miyawe sozi yakwe ivi, “Nehilota sozi, naonaga mkate wa shaili ukatongolokela kwe nk'hambi mwa Wamidiani, noutowa dihema niyo dyagwa hasi pele.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Miyawe niyo amhitula, “Mbuli ino nuko kugamba ni dibamba dya Gidioni mwana Yoashi mnt'hu ywa Izilaeli. Mnungu kamwink'ha udahi wa kuwahuma watowani wose wa Midiani.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidioni eze eve ivo wakusimuila sozi iyo, afikaga madi niyo amvika Mnungu, auyaga mwe nk'hambi ya Waizilaeli, akagamba, “Inukeni kiteni kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kakink'ha uhumi mwe difyo dyose dya watowani wa Wamidiani.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Niyo awapanga wadya want'hu magana matatu, na kuwaika mwe mafyo matatu niyo awenk'ha magunda na nyungu ina magala. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Akawagamba, “Heza mpaka hank'handa ye nk'hambi mnikaule icho nenidamanye nanywe mdamanye iivo. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Aho nenitowe digunda, miye ne difyo dyangu, nyose toweni magunda kulawa kila hant'hu kuzunguluka ink'hambi na kugutila kwa izwi kulu, ‘Kwajili ya Zumbe Mnungu na kwaajili ya Gidioni!’”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Gidioni ne difyo dyakwe dya want'hu gana wabulaga mwo lumbili lwe nk'hambi umwo kilo cha gati chandaga kihagihi, aaho wamizi weze wakesakanye. Gidioni na want'hu wakwe watowaga magunda yawe niyo watula zinyungu zawe izo wenulaga mwe mikono yawe. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Mafyo yose matatu kwa hamwenga watowaga magunda na kutula nyungu zawe. Mwe mikono yawe ya kumoso watozaga magala mikono yawe ya kulume nayo watozaga magunda na kuyatowa, na kugutila kwa izwi kulu wakagamba, “Sime kwaajili ya Zumbe Mnungu na kwaajili ya Gidioni!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Wakimalaga kila yumwenga hant'hu hakwe kuizunguluka ink'hambi. Fyo dyose dya wank'hondo dyasambalaga na kugutila. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Want'hu wa Gidioni weze watowe magunda yawe Magana matatu, Zumbe Mnungu awatendaga Wamidiani wakonge kutowana woho kwa woho mwe nk'hambi. Wadya wasigale wanyilikaga mpaka Betishita kuhinga Zelela, mpaka mwo mhaka wa Abeli Mehola hagihi na Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Waizilaeli we dikabila dya Nafutali na Asheli na Manase, wose wetangwagwa niyo wawagulusa, Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidioni niyo atumaga wegala ulosi mwe isi yose ye vigulu va Efulaimu wawagambe, “Seleeni mkawatowe Wamidiani, ikeni wamizi kwo mto wa Yolodani ne vizuto vakwe mpaka Beti Bala vileke Wamidiani wasekomboka.” Ivo wagosi wose wa Efulaimu wezaga na kuutaha mto Yolodani mpaka Beti Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Wawatahaga vilongozi waidi wa Wamidiani, Olebu na Zeebu. Na kumkoma Olebu mwo luwe lwa olebu, Zeebu naye wamkomelaga hant'hu ha kuminyila zabibu uko Zeebu, wagendeelaga kuwagulusa Wamidiani. Niyo wamwigaila Gidioni mitwi ya Olebu na Zeebu, Gidioni andaga Ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Wamidiani wahumwa pele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Niyo Want'hu wa Ifulaimu wamgamba Gidioni, “Nii hukitange umwo ukagenda kutowana na Wamidiani? Nii wakitenda ivi?” Walabilaga kwa usungu kwe mbuli iyo.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Mna Gidioni awagambaga, “Kiya nehadaha kudamanya hakikudaha kuliganywa na kiya mdamanye nyuwe. Naho hata kiya kidamanywe ni want'hu wa Ifulaimu kitendesa uwedi kujink'ha kiya kidamanywe ni want'hu wo lukolo lwangu lwose. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Hamwenga na ayo, kwa udahi mkulu wa Mnungu muwakoma wakulu waidi wa Wamidiani, awo Olebu na Zeebu. Miye hidamanyai kikuligana na ivo?” Gidioni eze alonge ivo hawagendeele naho kunda na maya.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Mwo lupisi ulo, Gidioni na want'hu wakwe magana matatu wabulaga kwo mto Yolodani niyo wadendeluka. Hamwenga na kugamba wasokelesaga, wagendeelaga kuwagulusa awo wank'hondo wawe. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Umwo weze wabule Sukoti, awagambaga want'hu wo mzi, “Nawalombezani nk'hande ludodo kwaviya want'hu wangu wasokelesa, name nikei nawagulusa maseuta wa Wamidiani awo Zeba na Salimuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Mna wakulu wa Sukoti wagambaga, “Hakikudaha kuwenk'ha nk'hande watowani wako, kwaviya hamnati mumtahe Zeba na Salimuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Ivo Gidioni niyo agamba, “Vedi! Umwo Zumbe eze anink'he udahi wa kuwataha Zeba na Salimuna neni wakwalabule ne miwa ne mbigili ya kwedijangwa!” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Iviyaiviya Gidioni aitaga Penueli niyo alombeza enga ivo alombeze kwa want'hu wa Sukoti, mna want'hu wa Penueli wahitulaga enga ivo wahitule want'hu wa Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Ivo Gidioni niyo awagamba, “Heza kuuya kwa wedi, neni umole mnala uno.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna wandaga uko Kalikoli, hamwenga ne difyo dya watowani wawe mlongo na shano alufu. Awo nawo wasigalaga du, kwaviya watowani watuhu gana na milongo miidi alufu wakomwagwa. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidioni agendaga mwe sila ya uchuuzi mwo lwega lwe dijangwa, ulailo wa zuwa wa Noba na Jogibeha niyo waditowa idifyo idyo kwa kuditukiza. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Maseuta waidi wa Wamidiani, awo Zeba na Salimuna wanyilikaga mna Gidioni awagulusaga na kuwagwila niyo aditenda idifyo idyo dya watowani dingile kizingizo.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Gidioni mwana Yoashi auyaga kulawa kwe nk'hondo akombokela kwe mneka wa Helesi <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Uko amgwilaga mbwanga yumwenga ywa Sekoti niyo amuuza. Mbwanga uyo amwandikilaga mazina ye vilongozi na wadala wamanyikise wa Sukoti, uwazilo wawe wandaga want'hu milongo mfungate na mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidioni aitaga kwa want'hu wa Sukoti niyo awagamba, “Mwakumbukila ivo mwalemelaga kunambiza mkagamba hamkudaha kuwenk'ha nk'hande watowani wangu wosokelese. Nehinda hinati niwatahe Zeba na Salimuna, haluse Zeba na Salimuna ni awa aha.” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Awasulumizaga vilongozi wa Sukoti kwa muwamba ngoma ne mbigili ya mwe dijangwa. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Iviyaiviya aumolaga umnala wa Penueli niyo awakoma want'hu wose wo mzi uwo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Akajika Gidioni awauzaga Zeba na Salimuna, “Togoleni we vivihi awo muwakomile uko Tabali?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Niyo wamhitula, “Wandaga enga ivo wili weye, kila yumwenga andaga enga mwana seuta.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Niyo Gidion agamba, “Awo wandaga wandugu zangu, chonk'hile tombo dimwenga. Nakelisa ikindedi, yandile hamwa wakomile hegu hyawakomileni.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Niyo amgamba mwanawe mkulu ywe kilume uyo Yateli, “Kimala uwakome.” Mna uyo mwanawe ogohaga kuwakoma kwaviya andaga akei mwana mdodo.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Aho Zeba na Salimuna wamgambaga Gidion, “Kikome weye mwenye kwaviya ino ndima ya mnt'hu mgima.” Ivo Gidioni awakomaga niyo aguha mikufu yandaga mwe zisingo ze zingamia zawe.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Akajika aho Waizilaeli wamgambaga Gidioni, “Unde kilongozi ywetu ivi haluse, ukahalawa welekwa wako nawo wande vilongozi kwaviya kukikombola kulawa kwa Wamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidioni niyo awahitula, “Heninde miye kilongozi ywenyu hegudu hata wanangu. Zumbe niye naande kilongozi ywenyu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Mna niyo awagamba, “Nehaunga kint'hu kimwenga kulawa kwenyu. Kila yumwenga ywenyu anink'he ziheleni ziya mzitahile.” Wamidiani wandaga Waishumaeli wavalaga heleni za zahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Want'hu niyo wamhitula, “Chelelwa kukwink'ha.” Ivo watandikaga zisuke hasi niyo kila yumwenga aika umwo ziheleni izo atahaga. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Ziheleni ze zahabu izo Gidioni azipataga zabulaga kilo milongo miidi, naho izo hiyo hamwenga na zia ahokelaga na heleni, mikufu ya mwe singo, suke za zambalau, izo wavalaga maseuta wa Mediani ne mikufu yavaligwe mwe zisingo ze zifalasi ne zingamia zawe. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidioni adamanyaga hili kulawa mwe vint'hu ivo na kukiika mwo mzi wakwe uwo Ofuli. Waizilaeli wose wagendaga kukivika idyo dihili dyanda lwinika kwa Gidioni na want'hu we mp'huga yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Ivo Wamidiani wahumwagwa ni Waizilaeli niyo Waizilaeli wanda hawakuwogoha naho. Isi yandaga ya utondowazi kwa miaka milongo mine mpaka hadya Gidioni eze abanike.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifile ya Gidion</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gidion uyo Yelu Baali mwana Yoashi, auyaga kwe kaya yakwe niyo ekala uuko. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Andaga na wana kilume milongo mfungate kwaviya andaga na wavele wengi. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Iviyaiviya andaga na muwele wakwe uko Shekemu uyo amwelekelaga mwana amwink'haga zina niye Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gideon mwana Yoashi abanikaga akanda na miaka mingi niyo amoselwa msanga kwe kikuta cha ise Yoashi uko Ofuli umzi wo lukolo lwa Abiezali.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Gideon eze abanike, Waisraeli wamlekega Mnungu niyo waiuiya milungu yawe na kuivika. Wamtendaga Baali Beliti kunda mnungu ywawe. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Naho hawagendeele kumvika Zumbe Mnungu ywawe awakombolaga kwa wank'hondo wawe wabindaga wingi awo wawa zungulukaga nt'hendelo zose. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Naho hawandaga wedi kwe mp'huga ya Gidioni, hamwenga na ayedi yose awatendele Waizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleki mwana Yelu Baali aitaga kwo mzi wa Shekemu ukwo wekalaga wanduguze dya nine niyo awagamba, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Wawauze want'hu wa Shekemu, nomkaunga vihi? Kugamba mlongozwe ni wana Gidioni wose milongo mfungate, hegu mwaunga mlongozwe ni yumwenga mwa woho? Mkumbukile kugamba Abimeleki ni mwana ywenyu wenye.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Ivo wanduguze dya nine dya Abimeleki wawagambilaga want'hu wose wa Shekemu mwe mbuli yakwe, want'hu wa Shekemu nawo walamulaga wamtimile Abimeleki kwaviya andaga ndugu ywawe. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Ivo vilongozi wa Shekemu wamwink'haga vibesu va masawa milongo mfungate kulawa kwe nyumba nk'hulu ya mviko ya Baali Beliti niyo wamwink'ha Abimeleki. Vibesu ivo awalihaga want'hu wahezi awo vileke wamtimile kila aho aitaga. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Aitaga nawo kwe kaya ya ise uko Ofula, eze abule kudya awakomaga wanduguze wose milongo mfungate, awo wana Gidioni kwa iwe dimwenga. Mna Yotamu uyo umdodo mwa wana Gidioni akefisaga, yehe hakomwagwa chu. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Ivo want'hu wose wa Shekemu, hamwenga na wa Beti Milo waduganaga ho mti wa mwaloni uwo wandile hagihi na Shekemu wamwiika Abimeleki kunda seuta ywaywe.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Umwo Jotamu eze eve ivo akwelaga kwo lunenengwa lwo mnima Gelizimu niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu akawagamba, “Nitegelezeni nyuwe want'hu wa Shekemu, uneva mwaunga Mnungu awategelezeni! <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Zuwa dimwenga maziti yagendaga kusagula seuta ywawe. Niyo waugamba mzeituni, ‘Weye unde seuta ywetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Mzeituni niyo wahitula, ‘Togoleni nenileke kulava amavuta yo yakuungiswa ni milungu na want'hu vileke ninde seuta ywenyu?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Maziti niyo yaugamba mtini, ‘Wize weye unde seuta ywetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Mna mtini niyo wawahitula, ‘Togoleni nenileke kweleka matunda yedi yanamwiile, mna ninde seuta ywenyu?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Ivo maziti yaugambaga mzabibu, ‘So weye unde seuta ywetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Mna mzabibu wahitulaga, ‘Togoleni nenileke kweleka matunda yakuwagela kinyemi milungu na want'hu nikegele nk'huswank'huswa ya kunda seuta ywenyu?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Naivo elo niyo maziti yawiitila mti una miwa na kuugamba, ‘So weye unde seuta ywetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Udya umti we miwa niyo wagamba, ‘Uneva mwaunga ninde seuta ywenyu haya soni mwikale he mp'heho yangu. Uneva hamkuunga moto ukimp'huke kulawa mwa matambi yane zimiwa kwo kuyoka myeleti ya Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotani agendeelaga kulonga, “Togoleni nomnda na makawiilo yedi na uhuwilwa umwo mkamtenda Abimeleki kunda seuta? Togoleni mumtendela uwedi Yelu Babaali viligane ne zindima zakwe? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Kumbukileni kugamba tate awatowanilagani. Andaga hagihi na kwaza ugima wakwe kwajili yenyu kuwayokolani nyuwe kwa Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Mna dielo mumhituka tate ne mp'huga yakwe. Muwakoma wanawe, want'hu mfungate kwa iwe dimwenga, nanywe mumtenda Abimeleki kunda seuta ywenyu, umwana ywo mvele mtumwa kwaviya yehe ni ndugu ywenyu na kumtenda seuta ywa Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Haluse uneva kiya mumtendele Gidioni ne mp'huga yakwe mtenda kwa makawiilo na uhuwilwa, indeni na kinyemi na Abimeleki yehe naye ande na kinyemi na nyuwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Mna uneva hiyo ivo moto ulawe kwa Abimeleki no kuwoka want'hu wa Shekemu na Beti Milo. Moto ukimp'huke kulawa kwa want'hu wa Shekemu na Beti Milo na kumwoka Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Yotamu anyilikaga na kugenda kwikala uko Beeli kwaviya amwogohaga nduguye Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki aikailaga Izilaeli kwa miaka mitatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Mnungu awatendaga Abimeleki na want'hu wa Shekemu wasekuivana. Want'hu wa Shekemu niyo wasaguka kulawa kwa Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Ino neilaila vileke Abimeleki na want'hu wa Shekemu, awo wamwambizaga mwo kuwakoma wana milongo mfungate wa Gidioni walihizwe mwo ukomi wawe. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Ivo elo kwajili yo unk'hondo na yehe want'hu wa Shekemu waikaga want'hu kwo lunenengwa lwe vigulu wawanyatile want'hu, vileke inde mnt'hu yeyose ombokelaga aho. Want'hu awo wamhokaga icho wandaga nacho. Abimeleki agambilwagwa imbuli ino.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Niho Gaali mwana Ebedi aitaga Shekemu akanda na wanduguze, want'hu wa Shekemu niyo wamhuilisa Gaali. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Waitaga kwe nk'honde ye mizabibu yawe niyo waha zabibu wahaga zabibu na kuziminya na kudamanya zuwa dya kinyemi na kwingila kwe nyumba ya mnungu ywawe, wadyaga no kunywa niyo wamhomola Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali mwana Ebedi niyo agamba, “Abimeleki niye ani? Suwe want'hu wa Shekemu kivivihi vikuleka kimdamanyile Abimeleki? Gidioni na Zebuli mkulu ywakwe ywa watowani wadamanyileni want'hu wa Hamoli, babaakwe ywa Shekemu, mna nii kimdamanyile Abimeleki? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Yandile ni miye huwalongoza want'hu awa nehamuusa Abimaleki, nehamgamba ‘Ikalumwe mafyo yako, so uku kitowane!’”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli, mkulu wo mzi afaga maya eze eve ivo alongile Gaali. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Ivo egalaga wegala ulosi kwa Abimeleki kwa kinyele akagamba, “Gaali mwana Ebedi na wanduguze weza mwo mzi wa Shekemu vileke wakukindile usekwiza mwo mzi. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Haluse weye na want'hu wako mnyilike nekilo mkanyatile kwe zink'honde. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Mwinuke luvi kilokilo vileke muukump'hukile umzi. Naho Gaali na want'hu wakwe wakawabasani mtowane, niho muwatowe kwa kila luneka nompate!”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleki na want'hu wakwe wose wenukaga nekilo na kunyatila hagihi na Shekemu wakanda mwe vifyo vine va watowani. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Umwo Abimeleki na want'hu wakwe eze aone Gaali kafosa kuse, naho kakimala he nk'hili yo mzi, Abimeleki hamwenga na awo want'hu andaga nawo afosaga uko wandile wakanyatila. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali eze aone amgambaga Zebuli, “Kaula! Kuna want'hu wakwiza kulawa kwo lunenengwa lo milima!” Zebuli niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">“Weye waona du vizuli ve milima enga want'hu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaali niyo alonga naho, “Kaula! Kuna want'hu wakulawa hagatigati yo milima naho fyo tuhu dyeza ne sila kulawa kwo mti wa mwaloni wa walaguzi!”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Zebuli niyo amgamba, “Wikuhi weduvi wako haluse? Hiyo weye wagambile nii kimdamanyile Abimeleki. Togola awa hiyo want'hu wadya noukawabela? Haya ita ukatoane nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaali awalongozaga want'hu wa Shekemu niyo atowana na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Mna Abimeleki amgulusaga mpaka kwe nk'hili nk'hulu yo mzi, naho wengi walumiziswagwa umwo wandaga wakanyilika. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki ekalaga uko Aluma, Zubali naye amgulusaga Gaali na wanduguze kulawa Shekemu naivo hawadahile kwikala aaho naho.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Zuwa ditimile Abimeleki aonaga kugamba want'hu wa Shekemu wandaga wakafunganya waite kwe zink'honde, <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />ivo aguhaga want'hu wakwe niyo awapanga vifyo vitatu vileke awonawo wanyatilaga kwe zink'honde, naye akaulaga, eze aone want'hu walawaga kwe mizi awakump'hukilaga na kuwa koma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Umwo Abimeleki na want'hu wakwe andile wakasunguza kugenda kwamila kink'hili yo umzi, ivifyo viidi vituhu vawakump'hukila want'hu kwe zink'honde na kuwakoma wose. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Kutowana kwagendeelaga msi wose. Abimeleki autahaga umzi na kuwakoma want'hu wose wandaga umwo. Awokaga moto umzi niyo awanjazila munyu.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Umwo wakaya wose wo mnala wa Shekemu weze weve ivo, wengilaga mwe digomela dyetangwagwa nyumba ya kumvika Eli Beliti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki agambilwagwa kugamba wakaya wose wandile mwe digomela dya Shekemu wakeduganya hamwenga, <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />ivo akwelaga kwo mnima Zalimoni akanda hamwenga na want'hu wakwe. Aguhaga hoya niyo akant'ha tambi dyo mti na kudiika mwe diega dyakwe. Awagambaga wadya want'hu andaga nawo wasunguze kutenda enga ivi yehe atendile. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Ivo kila yumwenga akant'haga tambi dya ziti niyo wambasa Abimeleki niyo wayaumbika mwo zink'handula ze digomela. Wayatimp'haga moto kukanda na want'hu kundani ye digomela. Want'hu wose wandaga uumwo wabanikaga. Kwandaga na want'hu alufu imwenga, wagosi kwa wavele.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Abimeleki aitaga Tebezi na kuuzunguluka niyo autaha umzi. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Mna hagati ho mzi uwo kwandaga na mnala utogile, niyo kila mgosi na wavele na wakaya wo mzi wanyilikilaga kwo mnala uwo. Wavugailaga ulwivi na kukwela kulanga kwe digulu dyakwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki ezaga niyo aukump'hukila umnala, akwelaga kwo lwivi vileke autimp'he moto mnala. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Mna mvele yumwenga amduilaga iwe dya kusigint'hila niyo autula umtwi wakwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Abimeleki asunguzaga kwitanga mbwanga andaga akamwinuila vitowanilo vakwe akamgamba, “Somola isime yako unikome. Hikuunga ikagambigwa hikomwa ni mvele.” Ivo uyo mbwanga amsenga ne sime niyo amkoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Waizilaeli weze waone Abimeleki kabanika, wose wauyaga kila mnt'hu kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Naho ivo nivo Mnungu amlihizaga kwa masa Abimeleki amtendelaga ise kwa kuwakoma wanduguze milongo mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Ivo Mnungu kawaliha want'hu wa Shekemu waupate uihi waudamanye. Ivo ligito dya Yotamu mwana Yelu Baali niyo dyawapata.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola anda mlamuzi ywa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Aho Abimeleki eze Abanike, Tola mwana Pua mwezukuluwe dya Dodo ezaga kuwakombola Waizilaeli. Yehe andaga ywe dikabila dya Isakali naho ekalaga uko Shamili kwe isi ye ivigulu va Ifulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Tola ailongozaga Izilaeli kwa miaka milongo miidi na mitatu, abanikaga niyo amoselwa msanga uko Shamili.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaili naye anda mlamuzi kwa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Tola, eze abanike ezaga Yaili kulawa Gileadi. Yaili andaga mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli kwa miaka milongo miidi na miidi. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yaili andaga na wana milongo mitatu wandaga wakenulwa ni mp'hunda milongo mitatu. Naho awo wandaga na mizi milongo mitatu mwe isi ya Gileadi. Mizi iyo yagendeela kwitangwa kaya za Hawoti Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili abanikaga niyo amoselwa msanga uko Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Waizilaeli wadamanyaga uihi naho ha Zumbe kwa kuvika milungu ya Baali na Mashitalaloti na milungu ya Asilia na milungu ya Sidoni na milungu ya Moabu na milungu ya Amoni na ya Wafilisiti. Wasagukaga kwa Mnungu niyo waleka kumvika. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Ivo Zumbe awafiilaga maya want'hu wa Izilaeli niyo awatenda wekailwe ni Wafilisiti na Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />awo wawasulumizaga na kuwakunt'hiza Waizilaeli wandaga wakekala mwe isi ya Waamoli, ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani uko Gileadi kwa miyaka mlongo na mnane. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Naho Wamoni wombokaga mto Yolodani kugenda kuyatowa makabila ya Yuda na Benjamini na Ifulaimu Waizilaeli nawo wapatisaga makunt'ho. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Waiziaeli wamwiiilaga Zumbe wakagamba, “Kikutendela wavu, kwaviya kikuleka weye niyo chavika milungu ya Baali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Zumbe niyo awahitula, “Togoleni miye hiwakombole kulawa kwa Wamisili na Waamoli na Waamoni na Wafilisiti, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Waisidoni na Waamaleki na Wamidiani wawagelagani makunt'ho aho nk'hongo, mwize mniile hyawayokolagani kulawa kwawe? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Hamwenga na ayo mnileka miye niyo mwaivika milungu mituhu. Ivo, heniwayokoleni naho. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Iteni mkaiile milungu iyo mwiisagule vileke akawayokoleni mkanda mwa makunt'ho.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Mna Waizilaeli wagendeelaga kumwiiila Zumbe wakamgamba, “Kitenda wavu. Weye noukitende ivo ukuunga, mna chakulombeza kiyokole diyelo.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Niyo waiusa milungu ye zisi zint'huhu na kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, Zumbe Mnungu naye hadaile kugendeela kufinyiliza aho eze aone makunt'ho ya Waizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Waamoni wakeikaga lumwe wakatowane nk'hondo na Waizilaeli ivo waikaga nk'hambi aho Gileadi. Waizilaeli nawo wakeduganyaga hamwenga niyo waika nk'hambi uko Mizipa ya Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Vilongozi wa want'hu wa Gileadi wakeuzaga kugamba, “Niani naakakonge kutowana na Waamoni? Yeyose naatende ivo niye naande kilongozi mwe Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Elo, Jefita kulawa Gileadi andaga mtowani hekogoha uyo andaga mwana ywa mvele pamp'he. Ise andaga ni Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gileadi andaga na wana watuhu kwo mkaziwe we ndoza. Wana awo weze wakule wamgulusaga Jefita ahalawe mwe kaya yawe. Wamgambaga, “Homnde na ukipe wa kint'hu chochose kwa tati yetu, weye una nyokwe mtuhu.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Jefita awanyilikaga wanduguze niyo akwikala kwe isi ya Tobi. Aho handaga na want'hu waihile, wamzumilaga niyo wanda hamwenga naye kila aho nawaite.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Mazuwa mageke yeze yomboke Waamoni wagendaga kutowana na Waizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Vilongozi wa Gileadi wagendaga kumwitanga Yefita kulawa kwe isi ya Tobi. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Vilongozi awo wamgambaga, “Soo ukilongoze vileke kidahe kuwatowa Waamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Mna Jefita awagambaga, “Ivi hinyuwe mwaniihiyaga niyo mwanigulusa nihalawe mwe nyumba ya tate. Haluse nii mwaniizila umwo mkapata makunt'ho?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Niyo wadala wo mzi wa Gileadi wamgamba Yefita, “Chakuuiya weye haluse vileke wiite hamwenga na suwe na kuwatowa Waamoni. Kinawahuma neninde kilongozi ywetu mwa wose wakwikala Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefita niyo awagamba, “Uneva kinaitanya hatowane na Waamoni, niyo Zumbe anitenda niwahume, ni kindedi neninde kilongozi ywenyu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Wadala wa Gileadi niyo wamhitula, wakagamba, “Kizumila. Zumbe muwona mwa suwe, ikindedi nekidamanye enga ivo ulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Ivo Yefita aitaga nawo awo vilongozi wa Gileadi niyo want'hu wamtenda ande kilongozi ywawe. Yefuta avuzagiza kulonga ha Zumbe ziya zimbuli awagambile wadala wa Mizipa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Niyo Jefita atumaga wegala ulosi kwa seuta ywa Amoni vileke wakamuuze, “Una nk'humbizi yani na suwe? Nii ukaikump'hukila isi yetu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Seuta Amoni awahitulaga wadya wegala ulosi kugamba, “Umwo Waizilaeli wandaga wakalawa Misili watahaga isi yangu kukongela kwo mto wa Alinoni mpaka mto wa Yaboki na mto Yolodani. Haluse vuzeni isi iyo kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta atumaga naho wegala ulosi kwa seuta ywa Waamoni <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />wakanda na uhituzi uno: “Hicho kindedi kugamba Waizilaeli waguhaga isi ya Moabu isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Mna umwo Waizilaeli wandaga wakalawa Misili wombokelaga kwe dijangwa kuita kwe bahali ya Shamu na mpaka Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Naho watumaga wegala ulosi kwa seuta ywa Edomu kumlombeza kugamba wombokele mwe isi yakwe, mna seuta ywa Edomu hawazumile. Iviyaiviya amlombezaga seuta ywa Moabu, yehe naye hawazumile wombokele mwe isi yakwe, ivo Wazilaeli wagendeelaga kwikala aaho Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Mna niyo woho wombokela kwe dijangwa kuzunguluka isi ya Edomu na Moabu mpaka ulailo wa zuwa wa Moabu ng'ambu yo mto Alinoni na kuika nk'hambi aho. Mna aho hawadahaga kwomboka umto Alinoni kwaviya nuwo wandaga umhaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Waizilaeli watumaga wegala ulosi kwa Sihoni, na kwa seta ywa Waamoli ywa Heshiboni wakawalombeza kugamba wombokele mwe ziisi zawe waite uko kwe isi yawe. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Mna seuta Sihoni hawazumile Waizilaeli wombokele mwe isi yakwe. Aduganyaga idifyo dyakwe dya watowani niyo waika nk'hambi uko Yahasa na kuwakump'hukila Waizilaelil. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu ywa Waizilaeli awenk'haga uhumi Waizilaeli kwa uyo seuta ywa Sihoni ne difyo dyakwe dya watowani. Ivo Waizilaeli waiguhaga isi ya Waamoli wandaga wakekala aho kunda yawe. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Waguhaga isi yose ya Waamoli kukongela mto Alinoni mpaka kwo mto Yaboki, na kukongela ulailo wa zuwa kwe dijangwa mpaka usweelo wa zuwa wa mto Yolodani. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Kwaivo ni Zumbe, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli awagulusaga Waamoli kwajili ya want'hu wakwe Wazilaeli. Haluse weye waunga ukihoke isi yetu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Weye wageza kuiguha naho? Guha chochose wink'higwe ni mnungu ywako Kemoshi. Mna suwe nekiguhe kila kint'hu kink'higwe ni Zumbe Mnungu ywetu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Togola weye wagamba uywedi kumjink'ha Balaki mwana Zipoli, yudya seuta ywa Moabu? Yehe hakihigile hegu kutowana na suwe? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Waizilaeli wekalaga uko Heshiboni na Aloeli ne mizi imnk'handa yakwe ne mizi midodo yose mnk'handa yo mto Alinoni. Nii hamwiikombole mwo lupisi ulo? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Miye hiwatendeleni dyodyose diihile, hiyo vedi kutowa nk'hondo. Zumbe niye mlamuzi. Naalamule dielo mwa Waizilaeli na Waamoli.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Mna seuta ywa Waamoni aubelaga ulosi uwo kulawa kwa Yefita.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Niyo Muye ywa Zumbe Mnungu amwiziila Yefuta. Yefuta niyo amboka mwe isi ya Gileadi na Manase niyo abula Mizipa ya Gileadi niyo agendeela mpaka Amoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta aikaga kilapi kwa Zumbe kugamba, “Uneva nounink'he uhumi kwa Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />kint'hu chochose nenibwiilane nacho kulawa mwe nyumba yangu, umwo hauya no uhumi. Neni kilave kint'hu icho kunda malavo yo kokwa pele.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Ivo Yefula ombokaga umto akatowane na Waamoni. Zumbe naye niyo amwink'ha uhumi kwa Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Yefuta apataga uhumi mkulu na kuitaha mizi milongo miidi yandile Aloeli kuzunguluka Miniti na Abel Kelami. Ivo Waamoni wahumwagwa vitendese ni Waizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana kike ywa Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Niyo Yefuta abula kwe kaya yakwe uko Mizipa, mwanawe wakike amlailaga akeza kumsingila, akatoa kagoma kadodo naho avina naho andaga niye mwanawe yumwenga du heiina miyawe. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefuta eze amuone atatulaga zisuke zakwe kwa kinyulu niyo agamba, “Ha, mwanagu! Kuusokeza umoyo wangu! Nii akanda ni weye ukunigela usungu? Hiika kale kilapi kwa kukelisa kwa Zumbe, naho hikudaha kukiusa!”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Yudya kigoli niyo amgamba, “Uneva kuika kilapi kwa Zumbe, damanya kiya naukaunga udamanye kwangu, kwaviya Zumbe kalihiza kwajili yako kwa wank'hondo wako Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Mna amgambaga ise, “Nidamanyile kint'hu kimwenga du. Nileke kwa miezi midi du vileke hatalamke na wambuya zangu kwo mnima hahongeza kugamba nenibanike hahena kulombigwa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Ise amgambaga aite niyo amzumila kwa miezi midi. Yehe na wambuyaze wekalaga kwo mnima wakanda wahongeza kwaviya naabanike haheina kulombigwa naho haheina kweleka. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Miezi midi ize yomboke yudya kigoli auyaga kwa ise. Ise naye atendaga enga ivo amwikilaga kilapi Zumbe, yudya kigoli abanikaga akanda mwali na mazanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Naho niyo yanda ni kihendo kwa Waizilaeli, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />kugamba wana kike wa Waizilaeli waitaga hale kwa mazuwa mane kila mwaka waka mkumbukila yudya kigoli cha Yefuta Mgileadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefuta atowana nk'hondo na Waifulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Waifulaimu wakeikaga lumwe watowane nk'hondo, wadendelukaga mto Yolodani niyo wabula Zifoni, niyo wamgamba Yefuta, “Nii kudendeluka mhaka uwatowe Waamoni haheina kukigambila vileke kindanye? Haluse chayoka inyumba yako we mwenye ukanda mndani!”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Mna Yefuta niyo awagamba, “Want'hu wangu wandaga na nk'humbizi nk'hulu na Waamoni. Nawetangagani mna hamwezaga kunigombela kwa awo want'hu. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Nize nione kugamba hamwezaga, naitaga mwenye kwa kukelava ugima wangu niyo nomboka umhaka hatowane nawo, Zumbe naye niyo anik'ha uhumi mwa woho. Haluse nii mweza kutowana na miye?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Yefuta awaduganyaga hamwenga wagosi wose wa Gileadi na kuwatowa wagosi wa Ifulaimu na kuwahuma. Waifulaimu wagambaga “Nyuwe want'hu wa Gileadi mwe isi ya Ifulaimu na Manase, mwi want'hu wa mwe dijangwa kulawa Ifulaimu.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Wagileadi watahaga ivipink'ha vose vo Yolodani vileke kuzikindila sila zose za Waifulaimu wasekudaha kunyilika. Umwo Waifulaimu wagezaga kunyilika walombezaga vileke walekelwe kwomboka, Wagileadi wawauzaga, “Nyuwe mwi Waifulaimu?” Uneva walemelaga wakagamba, “Bule,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />Wamgambaga wagambe “Shiboleti.” Mna yehe niyo agamba “Siboleti,” Kwaviya Waifulaimu wandaga hawakudaha kutambula vedi. Ivo wamgwilaga na kumkoma ahoo he vipink'ha vo mto Yolodani. Mwo lupisi ludya want'hu alufu milongo mine na wane we dikabila dya Ifulaimu wakomwagwa.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Jefuta andaga mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli kwa miyaka mtandatu. Abanikaga niyo amoselwa msaga kwo umwenga mwe mizi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibizani, Elon na Abidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Yefuta eze abanike, Ibizani kulawa Betelehemu andaga niye mlamuzi ywa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Andaga na wana kilume milongo mitatu na wa kike nawo milongo mitatu. Awalozaga wanawe we kike kuse ye lukolo lwawe, naho niyo awaloza wanawe we kilume milongo mitatu kwa wana kike kuse yo lukolo lwawe. Ibizani andaga mlamuzi ywa Waizilaeli kwa miyaka mfungate, <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ibizani abanikaga na kumoselwa msanga uko Betelehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Ibizani eze abanike, Eloni kulawa Zebuluni niye andaga mlamuzi ywa Waizilaeli kwa miaka mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Eloni abanikaga na kumoselwa msanga uko Aijaloni kwe isi ya Zabuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Eloni eze abanike, Abidoni mwana Hileli kulawa Pilatoni andaga niye mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Andaga na wana kilume milongo mine na vyezukulu milongo mitatu awo wandaga wakenulwa ni milongo mfungate, andaga mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli kwa miaka mnane, <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Abidoni abanikaga na kumoselwa msanga uko Pilatoni mwe isi ye dikabila dya Ifulaimu mwe isi ye vigulu ya Waamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni elekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Wazilaeli wamtendelaga wavu Zumbe naho, Zumbe niyo awalekela Wafilisiti wawalongoze Waizilaeli miaka milongo mine.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Mwo lupisi ludya kwandaga na mnt'hu etangwagwa Manoa wo mzi wa Zola. Uyo andaga ni ywe dikabila dya Dani. Mkaziwe handaga na wana kwaviya andaga mgumba. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe amlailaga uyo mvele niyo amgamba, “Weye huna wana kwaviya ywi mgumba, mna nowinule ubovu iiviivi niyo wengila nyumba mwana kilume. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Ukaulise, use kuvata mp'hombe yoyose hegu kudya kint'hu chochose hekizumilwe ha Mnungu. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />kwaviya nowinule ubovu na kweleka mwana kilume. Fili zo mwana uyo zise kumogwa mbwitu kwaviya naande kaikwa kwa ndima ya Mnungu kwa kilapi kukongela dizuwa dyo kwelekwa kwakwe. Naakonge indima ya kuwakombola Waizilaeili kulawa kwa Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Yudya mvele agendaga kumgambila mgosiwe, “Mnt'hu ywa Mnungu kaniziila, naho nakanda ywa kutisa enga mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu. Himuuzile dizina dyakwe na uko alaile, naho naye hanigambile idizina dyakwe. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Mna nakanigamba, ‘Nowinule ubovu na kwingila nyumba mwana kilume. Naho kanigamba nise kuvata mp'hombe na kudya kint'hu chochose hekizumilwe ni Mnungu, kwaviya uyo mwana kilume naaikwe kwa ndima ya Mnungu kwa kilapi mwo wikazi wakwe wose.’”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Manoa niyo alombeza Zumbe akagamba, “Zumbe chakulombeza, uyo mnt'hu ywa Mnungu umtumile akiuiye akigambile nekimdamanyilei uyo mwana kilume umwo akeza kwelekwa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Mnungu adamanyaga kiya Manoa alombezaga, naho yudya mtumigwa ywa Zumbe auyaga kwa yudya mvele aho andaga kekala uko kwo mgunda mna mgosiwe handaga hamwenga naye. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Ivo yudya mvele asunguzaga kuguluka no kugenda kumgambila kugamba, “Kaula yudya mnt'hu kaniziila mwe dizuwa diya, keza naho.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa akimaalaga niyo amtimila mkaziwe. Amuitilaga yudya mnt'hu niyo amuuza, “Weye niwe walongaga na mkazangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Niyo yudya mnt'hu amhitula, “Heiye.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manoa niyo amgamba, “Haluse elo, mbuli zako nezi kint'he ini, mbwanga uyo naande ywa vivihi naho ndima yakwe neinde ni ihi?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe ahitulaga, “Mkazio akaulise aungwa adamanye kila kint'hu nimgambile, <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />hakuungwa kudya chochose kikulawa mwe zabibu naho asekuvata mp'hombe yoyose hegu kudya kint'hu chochose hekizumilwe ni Mnungu. Adamanye kila kint'hu kiya nimgambile.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa andaga hamanyize kugamba uyo andaga mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Nakulombeza hake goja usekuita, kikuchinjile mwana mbuzi.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Mna mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe niyo amhitula. “Hata uneva unanilemeza kuita henidye nk'hande yako. Mna uneva waunga ulave malavo ya kokwa pele vaungwa umwink'he Zumbe.” Manoa hamanyaga kugamba uyu andaga ni mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Manoa niyo agamba, “Kigambile dizina dyako vileke kize kikwink'he nt'hogola umwo zimbuli zako zikeza kulaila.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Yudya Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo amuuza, “Nii mwauza dizina dyangu? Zina idi ni dya kweheela.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Ivo Manoa aguhaga mwana mbuzi uyo na malavo ya unga niyo amlavila Zumbe aho he kilingo cha kutambikila mnanga mwo luwe, Zumbe Mnungu naye niyo adamanya vihungi aaho Maoa na mkaziwe wakakaula. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Umwo zindilija zandaga zika limbija kulawa aho hokulavila nt'hambiko, Manoa na mkaziwe wamuonaga mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe akakwela kuita kwe mbingu umwo mwe zindilija. Ivo Manoa na mkaziwe niyo wamvika Mnungu. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Manoa amanyaga kugamba uyo andaga mtumigwa ywa Zumbe Mnungu. Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu hamlaile naho Manoa na mkaziwe.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoa niyo amgamba mkaziwe, “Ikindedi haluse chabanika kwaviya kimuona Mnungu!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Mna mkaziwe niyo amgamba, “Uneva Zumbe aungile kukikoma hegu hahokele malavo yetu yo kokwa pele hegu malavo yetu yo unga mwe mikono yetu, naho hegu hakilagise aya yose na kukigambila kint'hu iki mwo lupisi ulu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Mvele yudya engilaga nyumba mwana kilume niyo amwink'ha zina niye Samsoni. Mwana uyo akulaga niyo Zumbe amvikila. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Muye ywa Zumbe wakongaga kukwezela umwo andaga Mahane Dani hagati ya Zolahi na Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na mvele kulawa Timna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Samsoni aseelaga kuita Timna. Uko aonaga mndele yumwenga ywa Kifilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Eze auye kaya awagambilaga welesi wakwe akagamba, “Hiyona mndele ywa Kifilisiti kudya Timna himbwedesa. Elo nilozeni ande mkazangu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Mna welesi wakwe niyo wamuuza, “Nii ukaita uko kwa Wafilisiti heweitile kwe dilago vileke ukalombe uko? Huwone yeyose mwo lukolo lwetu hegu mwa want'hu wetu wose wa Izilaeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Mna Samsoni amgambaga ise, “Mndele uyo niye nione huunga mniloze.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Welesi wakwe hawamanyaga kugamba andaga ni Zumbe akumlongoza Samsoni kwa ayo akudamanya, kwaviya Zumbe andaga akamwiikila lumwe Samsoni vileke awatowe Wafilisiti. Mwo lupisi ulu Wafilisiti wandaga wakawekaila Waizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Ivo Samsoni na welesi wakwe weseelaga kuita Timna. Umwo wakaita kwombokela kwo mgunda we mizabibu uko Timna, aaho zana simba dyalailaga ikabuma uku dikamwiziila. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Aaho Muye ywa Zumbe amtendaga Samsoni ande na ludole niyo aikangazula isimba ne mikono yakwe, enga ivo mnt'hu akuikangazula mwana mbuzi. Mna hawagambile welesi wakwe icho adamanye.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Weze wabule Timna, Samsoni niyo agenda kusimuila na yudya mndele amwelelaga vitendese. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mageke Samson auyaga kugenda kumlomba yudya mndele. Mwe sila umwo apagukaga niyo agenda kukaula idya isimba aikomaga. Eheelwagwa kwaviya abwiilaga tuluma dya nyuki naho kundani kwe kimba kiya kwandaga na uki. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Yehe aulundaga uki uwo ne mikono yakwe niyo adya uku akagenda, eze auye kwa welesi wakwe awenk'haga uki ludodo nao niyo wadya mna hawagambile kugamba uki udya walawaga mwe kimba che simba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Ise dya Samsoni aseelaga kuita kwa mndele niyo Samsoni adamanya wila aaho. Ino neinda ni kihendo kwa wabwanga kutenda ivo mwo lupisi ludya. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Wafilisiti weze wamuone Samsoni, wamwigailaga wabwanga milongo mitatu wakande hamwenga naye mwo wila. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni awagambaga, “Naunga niwenk'heni ngelo. Uneva mnadaha kunik'ha uhituzi we ngelo mwa mazuwa mfungate yo wila we ndoza yangu, nenimwink'he suke milongo mitatu za suke zing'aile na suke milongo mitatu zo wila. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Mna mdunduga kunigambila uhituzi we ngelo iyo mwa mazuwa ayo mfungate yo wila, nyuwe nomnink'he mavalo milongo mitatu na doti nt'huhu milongo mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Woho niyo wagamba “Kigambile ngelo iyo, kiitegeleze.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">“Kwa mta kudya kwalawa ludyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">Kwa mta ludole kwalawa mwiile.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Mazuwa matatu yomboka hahana ahitule ingelo iyo.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Mwe dizuwa dya kane wamgambaga mkaza Samsoni, “Mhembeleze mgosiyo vileke akigambile uhituzi ukulongwa mwe ngelo iyo. Huna tendile ivo chawatimp'hani moto weye hamwenga ne mp'huga ya iso yose. Weye na mgosiyo mkilalika aha vilele mkihoke ugoli wetu?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Ivo mkaza Samsoni ambasaga mgosiwe uku akaila niyo amgamba, “Ikindedi weye hukuniunga! Kuni ihia! Kuwenk'ha want'hu wa kwetu ngelo niyo hunigambile ulosi ukulongwa mwe ngelo iyo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samsoni niyo agamba, “Tegeleza, hata welesi wangu awo hiwagambile. Nii hugambile weye?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Mkaziwe ailaga kwajili ye ngelo iyo kwa mazuwa yose mfungate yo wila we ndoza yawe. Mna mwe mazuwa yasigale mwe dizuwa dya mfungate dye ndoza Samsoni amgambilaga mkaziwe ulosi we ngelo iyo kwaviya mkaziwe amtigizaga. Yudya mkaza Samsoni agendaga kuwagambila Wafilisiti kikulongwa mwe ngelo iyo. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ivo mwe dizuwa idyo kwandaga kukei kuswa, wagosi wa mwo mzi uwo wamgambaga Samsoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ni kihi kina mwiile kujink'ha uki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Kihi kina ludole kujink'ha simba?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:18">Samsoni ahitulaga kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Mwandile hamlimile ne ng'ombe yangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Hegu hamwamanyize uhituzi we ngelo yangu hata ivi haluse.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Aaho Muye wa Zumbe wamwiziilaga Samsoni niyo wamtenda ande na ludole, aseelaga Ashikeloni uko niyo akomaga wagosi milongo mitatu. Awahambulaga zisuke niyo awenk'ha wadya walavaga uhituzi we ngelo. Akajika aho, auyaga kwe kaya kwa ise na nine akanda na maya mwe kiya kilaile, <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />mna uyo mkaza Samsoni alozwagwa kwa mbwanga yumwenga mwa wadya wandile naye mwe ndoza yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Mwo lupisi lwo kuvuna ngano, Samsoni aguhaga mwanambuzi niyo agenda kumkaula mkaziwe, “Niyo amgamba mkwewe naunga ningile mwe chumba cha mkazangu vileke nimuone” Mna mkwewe alemelaga.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Mkwewe niyo amgamba, “Ikindedi nehagamba kumwihiisa ivo niyo namloza kwa yumwenga mwa wadya wandaga nawo mwe ndoza yako. Hata ivo mvunawe naye mndele kujink'ha yehe. Haluse umlombe yehe.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni niyo amgamba, “Heninde na masa kwa yadya huunga niwatendele Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Ivo Samsoni agendaga kugwila mabwasiko magana matatu niyo ayanyinya mikila yawe maidi maidi kwa hamwenga, niyo aika magala mwe mikila yawe. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Akajika ayakwelezaga magala ayo niyo ayalekela mabwasiko ayo niyo yengila mwe zink'honde za mizabibu za Wafilisiti na koka pele nk'honde ze ngano hamwenga ne ngano yandaga ikei kuvunwa hamwenga ne zink'honde ze mizeituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Niyo Wafilisiti wauzana, “Niani atendile mbuli ino?” Niyo wagambilwa, “Ni Samsoni yudya mkwewe kulawa Timna. Kwaviya Mnt'hu uyo amguhaga mkaziwe dya Samsoni na kumwink'ha yumwenga mwa wadya wandaga naye kwe ndoza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">Ivo Wafilisiti waitaga na kumoka kwa moto yudya mvele na ise. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni niyo awagamba, “Uneva nyuwe mdamanya mbuli enga ino, kindedi nakelisa kugamba henihalawe aha mpaka nilihize kiya mnidamanyile.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Ivo awatowesaga na kuwakoma want'hu wengi, niyo agenda kwikala mwo luwe lwa Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni awahuma Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Wafilisiti wezaga na kutowa nk'hambi mwe isi ya Yuda niyo wasambala hagihi ne mzi wa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Want'hu wa Yuda niyo wauzana, “Nii mwiza kutowana na suwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Niyo wawahitula, “Kiza vileke kimgwiile Samsoni kimtende enga ivo akitendile.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Ivo want'hu gana mlongo na nt'hatu wa Yuda waselaaga na kuita kwo luwe lwa Etamu, niyo wamgamba Samsoni, “Togola humanyize kugamba Wafilisiti wakikaila? Haluse kukitendelai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Niyo awahitula, “Miye hiwatendela enga viya wanitendile.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Wamgambaga, “Kiseela kikunyinye na kuwatenda Wafilisiti wakuike mwo udahi wawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samsoni niyo awagamba, “Keliseni kugamba homnikome nyuwe wenye.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Wamgambaga, “Ni vedi suwe hekikukome mna nekikunyinye na kuwatenda Wafilisiti wakuike mwo udhi wawe.” Ivo wamnyinyaga kwa sigi mbili mp'hya niyo wamguha kulawa mwe mp'hanga. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Eze abule Lehi, Wafilisiti wezaga na kugutila. Muye ywa Zumbe amgelaga ludole Samsoni ziya sizigi zimnyinyele mwe mikono yakwe zakant'hikaga enga luzi lokigwe moto niyo zamlekela niyo kutomoka hasi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samsoni aonaga jeje dya mp'hunda bisi niyo adiguha na kuwakoma Wafilisiti alufu. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Samsoni niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa jeje dya mp'hunda hiwakoma want'hu alufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kwa jeje dya mp'huda hiduganya malundo lundo ya vimba.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Eze ibinde kulonga audulaga diya dijeje na hant'hu aho etangagwa Lamasi Lehi nuko kugamba mnima wa jeje.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Samsoni atozagwa ni nk'hilu niyo amlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu akamgamba, “Kunink'ha mndima ywako uhumi mkulu. Togola haluse nounileke nibanike kwa nk'hilu na kutahigwa ni Wafilisiti heweitile kwe dilago?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Zumbe agubulaga hant'hu aho handaga na bome uko Lehi, mazi niyo yalawa. Samsoni anywaga mazi ayo niyo auwiywa ni ludole. Ivo nch'oko iyo yetangagwa Eni Hakole, naho iyuko uko Lehi mpaka ivi dielo.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsoni andaga mlamuzi ywa Waizilaeli kwa lupisi lwa miaka milongo miidi umwo Wafilisti wandaga wakaikaila isi.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni uko Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Samsoni aitaga kwo mzi wa Gaza, amuonaga mvele yumwenga pamp'he niyo agona naye. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Want'hu wa Gaza weze wagambilwe kugamba Samsoni andaga aaho, wahazungulukaga hant'hu aho niyo wagoja kilo chose mwe nk'hili yo mzi. Wanyamalaga zii kilo chose niyo wagamba, “Nekigoje kuche vileke kimkome.”<verse eid="JDG 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Mna Samsoni agonaga mpaka kilogati niyo enuka kilo icho niyo atoza mafigwe maidi ye zink'hili nokuyang'ola hamwenga ne didanga dyakwe niyo enula mwe mahega yakwe, aviguhaga mpaka kwo lunenengwa lwo mnima ukukaulana na Hebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Yeze yajinke ayo Samsoni amuungisaga mvele yumwenga etangwagwa Delila uyo endaga akekala mwe dikilongo dya Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Wakulu wa Wafilisti wamwizilaga Delila nakumgamba, “Mhembeleze Samsoni vileke umanye chotoko cho ludole lwakwe vileke kimtoze na kumnyinya na kumsulumiza. Unadamanya ivo kila yumwenga wetu naakwink'he masawa alufu na gana dimwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila niyo amgamba Samsoni, “Naunga unigambile chotoko cho ludole lwako na ivo ukuunga uhumigwe na unyinyigwe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni niyo amhitula, “Uneva wananinyinya kwa sigi mbisi za mfungate uta izo hezinyaile aho heninde no ludole naho neninde enga want'hu watuhu.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Wakulu wa Wafilisiti niyo wamwigailaga uyo mvele sigi mbisi mfungate za uta hezinyaile naye niyo amnyinya nazo Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila andaga kaika want'hu mwe chumba cha kundani vileke wamtoze. Niyo amwitanga, “Samsoni, Wafilisiti weza kukusulumiza” Samsoni niyo azinkant'ha ziya sizigi enga luzi ludugane no umoto. Ivo hahali amanyize chotoko cho ludule lwakwe.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila niyo amgamaba Samsoni, “Weye kunibwalasa naho kunidant'hiliza. Haluse nigambile wadaha kunyinywa kwa kint'hu chani.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsoni niyo amhitula, “Wananinyinya kwa sigi mp'hya izo hezinati kudamanyilwa kint'hu chochose naho neninde hina ludole enga mnt'hu yeyose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Ivo Delila aguhaga sigi mp'hya niyo amnyinya nazo. Niyo amwitanga “Samsoni Wafilisiti weza kukump'hukila.” Kwandaga na want'hu mwe chumba wakumnyatila. Samsoni niyo azikant'ha sigi izo kulawa mwe mikono yakwe enga luzi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila niyo amgamba Samsoni, “Hata ivi haluse kunidant'hiliza nigambile haluse wadaha kunyinywa na kint'hu chani?.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samsoni niyo amgamba, “Unadaha kuziluka zifili zangu vifundo mfungate na kuzinyinya na suke mwo mgamba wo kufumila suke, aho heninde na ludole. Neninde enga mnt'hu mtuhu yeyose”. <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Aho Samsoni andaga kagona, Delila niyo aluka fili za Samsoni vichungi mfungate niyo azinyinya mwe p'hindo ye suke, na kuvinyinyisa mwo mgamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:14">Niyo amgamba, “Samsoni, Wafilisiti weza kukukump'hukila!” Samsoni niyo enuka kulawa mwe zint'hongo na kuung'ola udya mgamba na kuitatula idya isuke imwe mp'hindo. <verse eid="JDG 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila niyo amgamba Samsoni, “Wadaha vivihi kugamba ‘Nakuunga,’ Mna hukunigambila chotoko cho ludole lwako? Kunibwalasa nk'hanana nt'hatu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Dilila agendeelaga kumsunk'hasunk'ha Samsoni kwa kumgambila mbuli iidya kila zuwa, moyo wakwe wafaga chevu na kunda hagihi na kubanika.<verse eid="JDG 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Ivo amgambilaga yudya mvele chotoko chakwe chose, niyo amgamba, “Lumo halwomboke mwo mtwi wangu kwaviya miye hiikwa kwa ndima ya Mnungu kukongela aho nandile mwe nda ya mnala. Uneva fili zo mwo mtwi ywangu zinamogwa neninde hina ludole enga mnt'hu mtuhu yeyose!”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Ivo Delila eze aone Samsoni kamgambila chotoko chakwe chose, atumaga ulosi kwa vilongozi wa Wafilisiti niyo awagamba, “Soni naho kwaviya kanigambila chotoko chakwe chose.” Ivo vilongozi wa Wafilisiti niyo weza kwa Delila wakanda na matundu mwe mikono yawe. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Delila niyo amgoneza Samsoni mwe viga vakwe, Samsoni naye niyo agona nt'hongo. Delila Amwitangaga mnt'hu vileke ammoge vichungi mfungate ve zifili mwo mtwi wakwe. Niyo Delila akonga kumsulumiza Samsoni kwaviya handga hana ludole naho. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila niyo amwitanga Samsoni, “Samsoni Wafilisiti weza kuku kump'hukila!” Samsoni niyo enuka kulawa mwe zint'hongo akagamba, “Nenifose kuse na kukekombola enga mazuwa yose.” Mna hamanyaga kugamba Zumbe Mnungu amlekaga. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Wafilisiti wamgwiilaga na kumn'gola meso yakwe, wamguhaga mpaka Gaza. Wakanda wamnyinya kwa mp'hingu za shaba, wamwiikaga uko vileke asigint'he ingano uko kwe divugailo. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Eze amogigwe, fili zakwe niyo zakonga kukula naho.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Ivo vilongozi wa Wafilisiti waduganaga kwa hamwenga vileke wamlavile malavo mnungu ywawe akwitangwa Dagoni, niyo wadamanya wila mkulu nakugamba, “Mnungu ywetu kamgela mnk'hondo ywetu Samsoni mwo udahi wetu.”<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Umwo wakanda na kinyemi mwe mioyo yawe wagambaga, Mwigaleni Samsoni eze avine vileke kinde na kinyemi. Ivo wamletaga Samsoni kulawa mwe diya divugailo naye niyo aseziga hameso yawe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:24">Niyo wamwika hagati ye mikola miidi. <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Want'hu weze wamuone Samsoni wamtogolaga mnungu ywawe wakagamba, “Haluse Mnungu ywetu mwiika mnk'hondo ywetu mwo udahi wetu, yudya abanange isi yetu na kuwakoma want'hu wetu wengi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga amtozile mkono wakwe akamlongoza, “Niike hant'hu aho hudaha kuitoza mikola itozile dizumba vileke name nigamile.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Naho dizumba diya dyandaga na want'hu wengi wagosi kwa wavele na vilongozi wose wa Wafilisiti wandaga umo, kulanga kwe dizumba idyo kwandaga na want'hu alufu nt'hatu wagosi kwa wavele, awo wandaga wakamkaula Samsoni ivo wandaga wakamsezigila. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Samsoni niyo amlombeza Zumbe Mnungu akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu nikumbukile nakulombeza unigele ludole uulu du, vileke nilihize kwa Wafilisiti wayang'oile meso yangu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samsoni niyo aitoza idya mikola miidi za hagati izo zitozile dizumba niyo aitozaga mikola iyo, mkola umwenga kwo mkono wo kulume, mkola umtuhu nawo mkono wo kumoso. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Samsoni niyo agamba, “Goja nibanike hamwenga na Wafilisiti!” Niyo aisindika idya mikola kwa ludole lwakwe lwose, diya dizumba niyo dyawagweela vilongozi na want'hu wose wandile mdya mwe dizumba. Ivo awakomaga want'hu wengi mwo lupisi lwo kubanika kwakwe kujink'ha mazuwa yo ugima wakwe.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Ivo wanduguze ne mp'huga yakwe yose wagendaga kumguha na kummosela msanga hagati ya mzi wa Sola no mzi wa Eshitaoli hagihi ne kikuta cha Manoa ise. Samsoni andaga mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli kwa miyaka mlongo miidi.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Mahili ya Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Mika andaga akekala mwe vigulu va Ifulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Zuwa dimwenga amgambaga nine, “Aho mbavi akubawilaga viya vibesu alufu na gana va masawa weye wamligitaga, Miye nakwivaga mwenye. Miye nnanavo vibesu ivo, ni miye naviguhaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Nine niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile kwa kuzumila kwako.”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Niyo amvuzila nine viya vibesu va masawa alufu imwenga na gana, nine niyo amgamba, “Vileke ligito idyo dise kukupata mwanagu miye naika masawa ayo kunda yakuka kwa Zumbe vileke nidamanye mahili ya kusongala na kuyakiziga kwa madini ya masawa. Elo haluse nakuvuzila weye.”<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mna niyo amvuzila nine. Nine aviguhaga viya vibesu va masawa magana maidi niyo amwink'ha yudya msani naye adamanyaga mahili ya kusongola na kuyakiziga kwa madini masawa, niyo ayaika mahili ayo mndani mwe nyumba ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Ivo Mika andaga na hant'hu hakwe ha kuvikila. Adamanyaga kizibau na vihili va milungu midodo niyo asagula yumwenga mwa wanawe kunda mlavant'hambiko ywakwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Mwa mazuwa ayo Izilaeli kwandaga hahana seuta, kila mnt'hu adamanyaga kiya aonaga chedi kwakwe.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Naho handaga na mbwanga yumwenga mwe mzi wa Betelehemu ye isi ya Yuda. Yehe andaga Mlawi ekalaga mwe dikabila dya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Mbwanga uyo ahalawaga mwo mzi uwo wa Betelehemu ye isi ya Yuda na kuzungula hant'hu hatuhu ho kwikala. Umwo akanda mwo utafi abwiilaga mwe vigulu va Ifulaimu mwe nyumba ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika niyo amuuza, “Weye kulawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Niyo amhitula, “Miye ni Mlawi kulawa Betelehemu ye isi ya Yuda, nazungula hant'hu ha kwikala.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika niyo amgamba, “Kikalanye unde tate naho mlavant'hambiko ywangu. Nohwink'he vibesu mlongo va masawa mpaka mlongo kila mwaka na suke na nk'hande.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Uyo Mlawi niyo azumila niyokwikala hamwenga naye enga yumwenga mwa wanawe. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Ivo Mika amtendaga mbwanga uyo Mlawi kunda Mlavant'hambiko wakwe na kwikala naye mwe nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Niyo Mika agamba, “Haluse namanya kugamba Zumbe naanidamanyile uwedi, kwaviya Mlawi uyu kanda Mlavant'hambiko ywangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Wadani waita kwikala Laishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Mwa mazuwa ayo Izilaeli kwandaga hahana seuta. Ivo kabila dya Wadani dyandaga dikazungula hant'hu ho kwikala kwaviya wandaga wakei kudaha kwingila mwe isi wenk'wagwa inde yawe mwa makabila ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Ivo dikabila dya Dani wawasagulaga want'hu washano wata udahi wawatume kulawa uko Sola na Eshitaoli vileke waite wakaipelembe isi. Want'hu awo waitaga ne zink'holo zawe zose. Niyo wawagamba, “Iteni mkaipelembe isi iyo.” Ivo want'hu awo wagonaga mwe isi ye vigulu va Ifulaimu niyo wekala umo mwe nyumba ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Weze wabule hagihi ne nyumba ya Mika, wamanyaga izwi dya yudya mbwanga Mlawi, ivo niyo wengila umwo na kumuuza, “Ni ani akuletile aha? Wadamanya ndima yani aha?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Yehe niyo awahitula, “Miye na Mika kizumilana ninde mlavant'hambiko ywakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Niyo wamgamba, “Chakulombeza kiuzile kwa Mnungu uneva nt'hambo yetu neinde yedi.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Yudya mlavant'hambiko niyo awahitula, “Iteni p'heho yedi. Nt'hambo yenu izumilwa ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Ivo elo wadya want'hu washano wahalawaga na mpaka Laishi, waonaga want'hu wa uko ivo wandile wekala kwa utondowazi enga want'hu wa Sidoni. Wandaga wakekala kwa uwedi hewekukawiila maihi naho hawehungukilwe ni chochose mwe isi. Wandaga hale na want'hu wa Sidoni naho wandaga hawana umbuya na want'hu wowose.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Weze wauye kwa wandugu zawe uko Sola na Eshitaoli wawauzaga, “Mwaonagai uko?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Niyo wawahitula, “Kimaleni,” “Kiteni kikaitowe isi ya Laishi. Kiiona isi iyo yedi. Mse kwikala aha haheina cho kudamanya, sunguzeni kugenda kuitaha isi iyo. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Mnaita uko nomuwabwiile want'hu hewekukawiila maihi naho ni isi nk'hulu, naho Mnungu kawenk'hani udahi wa kuiguha. Ni isi heikuhungukilwa ni kint'hu chochose.” <verse eid="JDG 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ivo want'hu magana mtandatu wa kabila dya Dani wakanda na vitowanilo vawe wahalawaga kulawa Sola na Eshitaoli. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Umwo wakanda mwo utafi watoaga nk'hambi uko usweelo wa zuwa wa Kiliati Yealimu mwe isi ya Yuda. Nivo vikuleka hant'hu aho mpaka ivi dielo hetangwa nk'hambi ya Dani. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kulawa uko waitaga mwe isi ye vigulu va Ifulaimu, niyo wabula mwe nyumba ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Wadya want'hu washano wagendaga kuipelemba isi ya Laishi wawagambaga wandugu zawe, “Haluse mmanya kugamba mwe nyumba izi kuna kizibao na mahili ya kusongola na vihili ve milungu midodo? Ivo fanyanyeni ivo mkuunga mdamanye.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ivo wadya wapelembi waitaga mwe nyumba ya Mika, niyo wengila ndani na kumuuza mbuli zakwe yudya mbwanga Mlawi. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Wadya want'hu magana mtandatu we kabila dya Dani wakanda ne vitowanilo vawe wakimalaga he nk'hili. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Wadya want'hu washano awo waitile kuipelemba isi wengilaga kundani na kuguha diya dihili dyo kusongola na kiya kizibao ne vihili ve milungu midodo. Watendaga ayo umwo yudya mlavant'hambiko akanda kakimala he nk'hili hamwenga na wadya want'hu magana mtandatu wakanda ne vitowanilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Want'hu awo weze wengile mwe nyumba ya Mika na kuguha mahili ya kusongola, ne kizubao na vihili ve milungu midodo. Yudya mlavant'hambiko niyo awaona na kuwauza, “Mwadamanyai?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Nawo niyo wamhitula, “Nyamala usekulonga chochose, kiitanye unde tatiyetu na mlavant'hambiko ywetu. Togola ni vedi weye kunda mlavant'hambiko kwa ajili ya nyumba ya mnt'hu yumwenga hegu kunda mlavant'hambiko we dikabila dimwenga dya Dani?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Yudya mlavant'hambiko niyo anda na kinyemi. Aguhaga kadya kafuko na diya dihili ne vihili va milungu midodo, niyo aita hamwenga na wadya want'hu. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Ivo wakongaga nt'hambo yawe, wawalongozaga wana wawe ne mifugwa yawe na ugoli wawe.<verse eid="JDG 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Umwo wakanda hale ne nyumba ya Mika, want'hu wandaga wekekala hagihi na Mika wetangwagwa niyo wadugana hamwenga, nawo wawatimilaga want'hu wa kabila dya Dani na kuwabwiila. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Weze wawatimile wawagutilaga want'hu we dikabila dya Dani nawo wahitukaga na kumuuza Mika, “Weye waungai ikuleka weza na fyo dya want'hu awa wose?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika awahitulaga akawagamba, “Nyuwe mwaiguhaga milungu yangu iyo niidamanye naho mwamguhaga mlavant'hambiko ywangu niyo mwakeitila ‘Haluse miye nna kint'hu chani kituhu?’ Ivo elo mwadaha vivihi kuniuza kugamba, naungai?”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Dani niyo wamgamba, “Usekulabila na suwe, unatenda ivo want'hu wata maya wadaha kukukoma weye ne mp'huga yako.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ivo want'hu we dikabila dya Dani niyo wakeitila, Mika eze aone wanaludole kujink'ha yehe ahitukaga na kuuya kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Nawo niyo waviguha vint'hu adamanyaga Mika no mlavant'hambiko andaga naye, nawo niyo wabula Laishi kwa want'hu heweina nk'huswank'huswa na want'hu hekawiile maihi niyo wawakomaoa kwa sime no kuwoka pele umzi wawe. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Kwandaga hahali mnt'hu yoyose wa kuwaokola, kwaviya wandaga hale na mzi wa Sidoni naho wandaga hawana umbuya na want'hu watuhu. Mzi uwo wandaga hagihi ne dikolongo dya Beti Lehobu. Want'hu wa kabila dya Dani wauzengaga naho mzi uwo niyo wekala umo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Mzi uwo niyo wetangwa zina dyakwe Dani, viligane ne zina dya tati yawe uyo elekwe na Izilaeli, mna mzi uwo aho nk'hongo wetangagwa Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Dani wakimalisaga mahili ya kusongola, naho yudya mlavant'hambiko ywawe Yonasani mwana Gelishomu mwezukulu ywa Musa na wanawe, wandaga walavant'hambiko wa kabila dya Dani mpaka want'hu we isi iyo aho waitaga kwe samo. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Mwo lupisi lwose Dihema Dikukile umwo yandaga Shilo.wandnt'hu we dikabila dya Dani wandaga wakavika dihili dyo kusongolwa idyo dyadamanyagwa ni Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mlawi na Muwele ywakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Mwa mazuwa ayo Izilaeli wandaga hawana seuta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 19:1">Kwandaga na Mlawi yumwenga ekale enga mgeni mwe isi ye vigulu va Ifulaimu, amguhaga muwele wakwe kulawa Betelehemu mwe isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Mna yudya muwele ywakwe amwihiaga uyo Mlawi, niyo amwasa na kuuya kaya kwa ise uko Betelehemumwe isi ya Yuda. Umwo eze ekale kwa lupisi lwa miezi mine, <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />niho mgosiwe agendaga kumzungula naho, aungaga akalonge naye vedi na kumvuza kwe nyumba yakwe. Amguhaga mndima ywakwe ne mp'hunda zakwe mbili, yudya mvele amwigalaga kwe kaya ya ise, ise naye aze amwone amhokelaga kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Mkwewe amgambaga ekale naye, niyo ekala kwa mazuwa matatu.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Mwe dizuwa dya kane wenukaga mtondo tondo niyo wafunganya wahalawe, ise dyo mvele amgambaga mkwewe, “Goja unde kudya nk'hande ludodo niho uite.”<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Ivo wekalaga wose waidi wakadya nk'hande kwa hamwenga. Niyo ise dyo mvele amgamba, “Nakulombeza ugone aaha kilo iki unde na kinyemi.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Yudya Mlawi eze akonge kufosa ise dya mkaziwe amlombezesaga asekuhalawa. Uyo Mlawi naye azumilaga niyo asigala aaho. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Mwe dizuwa dya shano enukaga kilokilo vileke aite mna ise dya mkaziwe niyo amgamba, “Udye nk'hande vileke upate ludole ugoje mpaka nomsi niho ufose.” Ivo wose waidi niyo wadya nk'hande kwa hamwenga.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Umwo eze enuke akeitile hamwenga na yudya mvele na mndima ywakwe, ise dya yudya mvele amgambaga, “Haluse diswa ugone naho aaha. Luvi kilokilo ufose na wiite kwe kaya yako.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Mna yudya Mlawi niyo alemela kugona naho, ivo afosaga na kuita mpaka mzi wa Yebusi nuko kugamba Yelusalemu akanda ne mp'hunda zakwe mbili hamwenga no muwele wakwe<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Umwo weze wande hagihi no mzi wa Yebusi zuwa dize diswe, yudya mndima niyo amgamba mkulu wakwe Mlawi, “Haluse kingile mwo mzi uno wa Wayebusi kigone aaho.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Mna yudya Mlawi niyo amgamba mndima ywakwe, “Bule, hekingile mwo mzi wa watakwiza kwaviya want'hu wakwe hiyo Waizilaeli. Nekigendeele ne nt'hambo mpaka Gibea.” <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Mlawi niyo amgamba mndima ywakwe, “Kiite hagihi na Gibea hegu Lama kikagone uuko.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Ivo wagendeelaga ne nt'hambo yawe, aho zuwa dize diswe wandaga hagihi na mzi wa Gibea uwo mzi we kabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Wengilaga mwo mzi vileke wagone umo. Weze wabule kwo mzi wagendaga kwikala ho lwazo lwo mzi, kwaviya hakwandaga na mnt'hu yeyose awahokelaga.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Kisingi kiya mnt'hu yumwenga mdala alawaga kwe nk'honde yakwe, mdala uyo andaga akekala mwe isi ye vigulu va Efulaimu mwo mzi wa Gibea enga mgeni. Want'hu mzi wa Gibea wandaga wa kabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Mdala uyo eze amwone yudya mnt'hu aho ho lwazo amuuzaga, “Walawahi naho waitahi?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Yudya Malawi niyo amhitula, “Chalawa Betelehemu mwe isi ya Yuda naho chaita kwe isi ye vigulu va Ifulaimu. Naitaga Betelehemu mwe isi ya Yuda na ivi haluse naita kwe kaya. Kwaviya hahana mnt'hu yeyose anihokele niite kwe kaya yakwe, <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />hata uneva kina kila kint'hu mani ya kuzink'ha zimp'hunda zetu naho kina mkate na divai kwaajili yo muwele ywangu no mndima ywangu na miye mwenye.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Yudya mdala niyo awagamba, “Tondowaleni! Sooni mwe nyumba yangu. Neniwenk'heni icho mkuunga, msekugona mwo lwazo lwo mzi uno.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Ivo awegalaga mwe nyumba yakwe na kuzink'ha mp'hunda mani. Nawo wahakaga mazi, niyo wadya nk'hande.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Umwo wakanda ne kinyemi mwe mioyo yawe, want'hu wavu hewemzumile Mnungu wa mzi uwo waduganaga he nyumba iyo. Wamgambaga yudya mdala uyo mta inyumba, “Mlave kuse yudya mnt'hu ezile kwakwo vileke kigone naye enga ivo kikugona na wavele.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Mna yudya mdala mta nyumba afosaga kuse na kuwagamba, “Bule wanduguzangu, nawalombeza msekudamanya uwavu uno. Kwaviya mnt'hu uyu mgeni ywangu msekumdamanyila uwihi wowose. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Kauleni aha eyuko mwali na mazanga yakwe na muwele ywa mnt'hu uyu. Neniwalave kwenyu muwaguhe muwatendele ivo mkuunga mna kwa mnt'hu uyu msekumtendela uwihi wowose.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Mna wadya want'hu hawamtegeleze. Yudya Mlawi amlavaga kuse yudya muwele ywakwe kwa wadya want'hu nawo wamguhaga na kugona naye kwa kumkakalisa kilo chose mpaka mtondo. Kwize kuche wamlekelaga akeitile.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Kilokilo yudya mvele auyaga kwe nyumba ya mgosiwe uko andile, eze abule ho lwivi niyo agwa na kugona aho mpaka kucha. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mgosiwe eze enuke akomolaga lwivi lwe nyumba na kulawa kuse vileke agendeele ne nt'hambo yakwe, niyo ambwila yudya mwele wakwe kagona hasi ho lwivi na mikono yakwe itoza ulwivi ulwo. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Niyo amgamba, “Kimala kiite.” Mna yehe hahituke. Yudya mgosi amwinulaga na kumwika mwe mp'hunda yakwe na kuita naye mpaka mwe nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Eze abule he nyumba yakwe, aguhaga ngola na kumkant'ha kant'ha yudya muwele vibesu mlongo na viidi ve vilungo vakwe niyo avigala vibesu ivo kwa kila kihande kwa kabila dimwenga dya Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Kila mnt'hu aone mbuli iyo agambaga, “Mmh! Mbuli enga ino hainati ilaile hegu kuoneka kukongela aho Waizilaeli weze walawe mwe isi ya Misili mpaka ivi dielo. Kifanyanyeni mwe mbuli ino! Togoleni kitende vivihi!”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wakeika lumwe kwa nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Waizilaeli wose kulawa kwo mzi wa Dani mpaka Beeli Sheba hamwenga na want'hu we isi ya Gileadi waduganaga na kunda kint'hu kimwenga uko Mizipa ha Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Vilongozi wose we kabila dya Izilaeli wagendaga kudugana na want'hu wa Mnungu, naho wandaga watoani wakubula alufu magana mane wakugenda lwa viga wandaga ne vitowanilo. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wevaga kugamba Waizilaeli weyawe wadugana uko Mizipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Waizilaeli niyo wamuuza yudya Mlawi, “Kigambileni wiihi uno ivo ilaile.” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Ivo yudya Mlawi mgosi ywa yudya mvele akomigwe niyo amhitula, “Miye na muwele wangu chabulaga Gibea mzi we kabila dya Benjamini vileke kigone uko. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Kilo icho wezaga wagosi wa Gibea na kuizunguluka inyumba iyo wakaunga wanikome, vituhu vakwe wagonaga na muwele ywangu kwa kumkakalisa niyo wamtendela vihile mpaka abanika. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Ivo nakiguhaga kimba cha yudya muwele na kuukant'ha kant'ha vibesu na kuvigala kwa makabila yose ya Izilaeli kwaviya wadamanyaga uihi na mbuli ya kuihiza mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Haluse nyuwe Waizilaeli mkafanyanye na kulava ulamuzi wenyu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Want'hu wose wenukaga hamwenga niyo wakagamba, “Hahana hata yumwenga mwa nyuwe akuunga auye kwe dihema dyakwe hegu kwe nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Ivi nivo kikuunga kiitendele Gibea. Nekiitowe lugumba kimanye ivo nekiitowe Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Nekisagule want'hu mlongo mwa kila want'hu gana wa Izilaeli, na want'hu gana mwa kila want'hu alufu, na want'hu alufu mwa kila want'hu alufu mlongo. Awo nawande na ndima ya kuwenk'ha nk'hande watowani wa Izilaeli, awo wakuunga wande na ndima ya kuusulumiza mzi wa Gibea mwe isi ya Benjamini kwaajili ya uwihi wawe wautendile mwe Izilaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Ivo wagosi wose wa Izilaeli waduganaga kwa hamwenga kwaajili ya kuutowa mzi uwo wa Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Makabila ya Izilaeli yatumaga want'hu waite kwe dikabila dya Benjamini na kuwagamba, “Ni wiihi wani uno udamanyike mwenyu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Ivo walaveni want'hu awo wata masa wandile Gibea vileke kiwakome na kuusa wiihi utendese mwe Izilaeli.” Mna want'hu we kabila dya Benjamini hawawategeleze ndugu zawe Waizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Ivo walawaga mwe mizi yawe uko Gibea vileke wakatowane na Waizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Want'hu wa kabila dya Benjamini waduganaga kulawa kwe mizi yawe, fyo dya want'hu alufu milongo miidi na mtandatu wata sime naho want'hu wakwikala mwo mzi wa Gibea wasagulaga watowani wadahi magana mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Mwa want'hu awo wasagulwe kwandaga na want'hu magana mfungate awo wakudaha kutowa ne dimoso, kila yumwenga adulaga iwe kwa nk'humbailwe na kutowa hadya akuunga. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli kuleka dikabila dya Benjamini wawaduganyaga wagosi alufu magana mane wakudaha kutowana kwa sime. Wose wandaga watowani wadahi.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila matuhu ya Izilaeli yatowana ne dikabila dya Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Waizilaeli waitaga hant'hu ha kuvika uko Beseli vileke wamuuze Mnungu, niani akuunga nalongole kukwela kuita kwe nk'hondo vileke atowane na kabila dya Benjamini?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Zumbe niyo awahitula, “Yuda niye akuunga alongole.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Kwize kuche Waizilaeli waitaga na kutowa nk'hambi hagihi no mzi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Waizilaeli niyo walawa na kugenda kutowana na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini uko hagihi na Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini walawaga Gibea niyo wawakoma want'hu alufu milongo miidi na waidi. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Mna Waizilaeli niyo wakegela moyo niyo wakepanga naho kwaajili ya kutowana nk'hondo enga ivo wakepangile nk'hongo. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Umwo wajike Waizilaeli wakwelaga kulanga niyo wakonga kuila ha Zumbe mpaka kisingi wakagamba, “Haluse kiite naho kikatowane nk'hondo na ndugu zetu we dikabila dya Benjamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Zumbe niyo awahitula, “Heiye, kweleni mkatowane nawo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Ivo idifyo dya Waizilaeli dyapataga ludole, <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Waizilaeli niyo waita mwe dizuwa dya kaidi wakatowane na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Mwe dizuwa idyo dya kaidi want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini walawaga Gibea na kugenda kuwatowa na kuwakoma Waizilaeli weyawe mlongo na mnane alufu, wose wandaga na sime wahinizwe vedi.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Akajika watowani wose wa Izilaeli waitaga Beseli nawo wekalaga ha Zumbe. Wafungaga mpaka kisingi na kumlavila Zumbe Mnungu malavo yo kokwa na malavo ya utondowazi. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Waizilaeli wamlombezaga ulangilizi Zumbe Mnungu uko Beteli. Mwo lupisi ulo Disanduku dye Ndagano dyandaga uko Beteli, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finehasi mwana Eliyazali mwana Haluni andaga mlavant'hambiko. Elo wamuuza Zumbe Mnungu, “Haluse kiite naho kikatowane na wandugu zetu we dikabila dya Benjamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Zumbe Mnungu niyo Awahitula, “Iteni kwaviya luvi neniwenk'heni uhumi mwa woho.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ivo Waizilaeli waikaga watowani wa kunyatila kuuzunguluka mzi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Waizilaeli wagendaga kutowana na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini mwe dizuwa dya katatu. Niyo wekepanga naho kuutowa mzi wa Gibea enga viya watendile mwo lupisi ludya lwa nk'hongo. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wafosaga vileke waite wakatowane nawo, Waizilaeli niyo wawagamba want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wafose kuse yo umzi. Niyo wakonga kutowana na kuwakoma want'hu mlongo na nt'hatu wa Izilaeli enga ivo watendile lupisi lwomboke mwe sila ikuita Beseli na Gibea na mwe isi za mwe nt'hindiga.<verse eid="JDG 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini niyo walonga, “Kiwatowa hameso yetu enga viya nk'hongo.” Mna Waizilaeli nawo niyo wagamba, “Suwe kinyilikeni vileke kiwasogeze kwe zisila zink'hulu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Wadya watowani wose wa Izilaeli wafosaga aho wendile niyo wekepanga naho uko Baali Tamali, wadya wandile wakawanyatila wasunguzaga kufosa aho wandile mwe nt'hendelo yo usweelo wa zuwa wa mzi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Niyo want'hu alufu mlongo wasagulwe mwe Izilaeli yose wezaga na kuitowa Gibea. Nk'hondo iyo yandaga nk'hulu vitendese mna want'hu wa Benjamini hawamanyize kugamba kubanangwa kwawe kwi hagihi. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo awambiza Waizilaeli niyo wawahuma want'hu wa Benjamini. Waizilaeli wawakomaga want'hu wa Benjamini alufu milongo miidi na washano na gana, wose wadahile kutowana na sime. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ivo want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wamanyaga kugamba wahumigwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Ivo Waizilaeli wawahumile Wabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Waizilaeli wauyaga kunyuma enga kugamba wawanyilika want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini vileke wawenk'he luneka weyawe wandaga wakanyatila wautowe mzi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Wadya wakuwanyatila wasunguzaga kwingila mwo mzi wa Gibea niyo wawakoma want'hu wose kwa sime. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Wadya watowani wose wa Izilaeli na want'hu wandaga wakanyatila wakeink'haga vilagiso kugamba wadya wakunyatila wakeza kuona mosi ukufunk'ha mwo mzi, na ivo wautowe umzi. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Mwo lupisi ulo want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wandaga wawakoma kale want'hu wa Izilaeli milongo mitatu niyo wagambana, “Kiwatowa enga viya kiwatoile hadya nk'hongo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Mna umwo diya vunde dyo umosi dize dikonge kufunk'ha kulawa mwo udya umzi, want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wahitukaga kunyuma niyo weheelwagwa kuwona umosi wafunk'ha mzi wose. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Niho want'hu wa Waizilaeli wahitukaga, aho want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wogohesaga kwaviya wamanya kugamba file yawe ihagihi. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Kwa ivo wahitukaga na kuwanyilika Waizilaeli kwe dijangwa mna hawainyilike ink'hondo iyo. Nawo want'hu wa Izilaeli wadya walaile mwe mizi idya wawakomaga uko. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Waizilaeli wawakulumbuzaga want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini kila hant'hu, wawatimilaga na kuwapata umwo wandaga wakehumuila mwo mzi wa Gibea wawakomaga wengi mwa woho mwe nt'hendelo yo ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Wawakomaga want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini alufu mlongo na mnane, wose wandaga watoani wadahi. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Want'hu watuhu we dikabila dya Benjamini weze wahituke na kugulukila kwe dijangwa mpaka kwo luwe lwa Limoni, Waizilaeli wawakomaga want'hu alufu shano wakanda mwe sila. Wawatimilaga naho want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini mpaka kwo mzi wa Gidomu uko wawakomaga want'hu watuhu Alufu mbili.<verse eid="JDG 20:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Want'hu wose we dikabila dya Benjamini wakomigwe wandaga alufu magana milongo miidi na shano wandaga watowani hewekogoha. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Mna want'hu magana mtandatu wanyilikaga kuhinga kwe dijangwa kwo luwe lwa Limoni na kwikala uko kwa lupusi lwa miezi mine. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Waizilaeli wauyaga na kuwakoma want'hu wose we dikabila dya Benjamini hamwenga na mifugwa na kila kint'hu chandaga aaho. Naho mizi yose wayokaga moto.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini wenk'higwa Wavele wa kulomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli waikaga kilapi wakanda uko Mizipa kugamba, “Hahande na mnt'hu yoyose akuunga amloze mwana kike ywakwe kwa want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Ivo want'hu awo waitaga Beseli niyo wekala uko ha Zumbe Mnungu mpaka kisingi, wailaga kwa izwi kulu na usungu, <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />wakagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu wa Izilaeli, nii mbuli ino yalaila niyo chahungukilwa ne dikabila dimwenga mwe Izilaeli?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Kwize kuche want'hu wazenga he kilingo cha kutambikila niyo walava malavo yo koka na malavo yo utondowazi. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Niyo wauzana, “Ni kabila dihi dya Izilaeli hadizile ho mdugano ha Zumbe Mnungu?” Kwaviya waikaga kilapi kugamba mnt'hu yoyose hebuile ha Zumbe Mnungu uko Mizipa aungwa akomwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Ivo Waizilaeli niyo wanda na kinyulu kwajili ya wandugu zawe Wabenjamini, niyo wagamba, “Dielo dikabila dimwenga dyaga. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Haluse nekitende vivihi vileke kiwapatile wavele awo wagosi we dikabila dya Benjamini wasigale? Kwaviya kikelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu kugamba hekiwenk'he wana kike wetu wande wavele wawe!”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Weze wauze uneva kwandaga na fyo mwa makabila ya Waizilaeli hediibuile kwo mdugano uko Mizipa, wabunk'hula kugamba hahana hata yumwenga akulawa Yabeshi Gileadi ezile mwe nk'hambi kwaajili yo mdugano. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Waizilaeli weze wawazigwe waonaga hahana mnt'hu yoyose wa Yabeshi Gileadi andaga aaho.<verse eid="JDG 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Ivo wadya wadugane wawatumaga watowani hewekogoha alufu mlongo na mbili, niyo awagamba, “Iteni Yabeshi Gileadi mkawakome wadya wakwikala uko wavele hamwenga na wana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Komeni wagosi wose wagonile na wavele na wavele wose wagonile na wagosi.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Wawabwilaga wandele wakwikala Yabeshi Gileadi wali na mazanga wakubula magana mane niyo wawegalaga mwe nk'hambi uko Shilo mwe isi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Ivo mdugano wose watumaga want'hu wegale ulosi wo utondowazi kwa want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini awo wandaga uko kwo luwe lwa Limoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Ivo wadya wagosi we dikabila dya Benjamini wauyaga kwa wandugu zawe, niyo wenk'higwa wadya wavele wasigale uko Yabeshi Gileadi. Mna wavele awo wandaga hawakukint'ha kwa wagosi.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Waizilaeli wawaonelaga mbazi want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ausaga uhamwenga wawe na makabila ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Ivo wadala wo mdugano niyo wagamba, “Haluse kitendei vileke kiwenk'he wavele awo wasigale, kwaviya wavele wose we dikabila dya Benjamini wakomwagwa pele? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Wadya wagosi wasigale we dikabila dya Benjamini vaungwa wenk'higwe wavele vileke wadigendeleze, kabila dyodyose dya Izilaeli disekwaga. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Mna hakikudaha kuwenk'ha wana kike wetu wande wavele wawe, kwaviya suwe Waizilaeli kiika kilapi cha kumligita, mnt'hu yoyose akumloza mwana kike ywakwe kwa mgosi we dikabila dya Benjamini.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Niyo wagamba, “Kaula kuna zuwa dya kinyemi kila mwaka dya Zumbe uko Shilo mkoma mahanya ya Beseli nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa mwe idya sila ikulawa Beseli kuita Shekemu na nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi ya Lebana.” <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Ivo wawalagizaga wadya wagosi we dikabila dya Benjamini na kuwagamba, “Iteni mkakefise mwe migunda ya mizabibu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Wandele wa Shilo wanalawa kuse na kuseziga, nyuwe laweni mwe iyo migunda ya mizabibu na kila yumwenga amgwiile mndele yumwenga akajika waguheni muite nawo mwe isi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Tati zawe hegu ndugu zawe waneza kulabila nekiwagambe, ‘Suwe chawalombezani muwaonele mbazi want'hu wa Benjamini na kuwaleka wawaguhe wavele awo, kwaviya hakipatile wavele wakukint'ha mwo luisi lwe nk'hondonk'hondo ya Yabeshi Gileadi. Naho homnde na masa kwaviya hiyo nyuwe muwenk'hile awo wana kike wenyu, homsengelwe kugamba mbananga ikilapi.’”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Wagosi we dikabila dya Benjamini wadamanyaga ivo. Umwo wandele wandaga wakaseziga, kila mnt'hu amgwilaga mndele yumwenga niyo amguha na kuita naye vileke ande mkaziwe. Ivo wauyaga mwe isi yawe na kuizenga mizi yawe uhya na kwikala umo.<verse eid="JDG 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Mwo lupisi ulo Waizilaeli wahalawaga, kila mnt'hu auyaga kwe dikabila dyakwe no lukolo lwakwe, kila mnt'hu aho apangilwe.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Mwe mazuwa ayo kwandaga hahana seuta mwa Izilaeli, kila mnt'hu adamanyaga kiya aone ni chedi.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>